<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka ya mumkumbo wa vitabu vine va lagano da sambi, vitabu avo volagusa vija Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi. Kila kitabu acho chokemigwa, “Injili,” fambulo jake Mbuli Inogile. Vitabu avo vandikigwa ako kumwande na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kipindi Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka. Luka handike mbuli za Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi ziiyeka, lakini vivija kandika mbuli ziwatendile wanahina zake ako kumwande Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka na kitabu acho kikemigwa Sang'hano za Iwatumigwa. Kuduhu munhu yojuwa kipindi gani hebu chandikiligwa kwahi kitabu kino cha Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka, lakini wanhu woifunza mbuli wose woitogolela kamba sengine chandikigwa behi ya mwaka wa 70 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandikaji kakala Luka yakalile mganga. Wandikaji wake na ulonzi uyekile volagusa kamba heyo kakala munhu yasomile. Luka kalonda kwandika mbuli imoja imoja kamba vizilawilile kwa Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi, kasimulila zimbuli kamba vizilawilile, muladi wanhu wayagwe wamwede kwa kusoma mbuli azo (Sula ya 1:1-3). Heyo hakalile Muyahudi bule (Wakolosai 4:10-14) na kandika vija wanhu haweli Wayahudi wahahile kuvijuwa. Mbuli ino yokoneka kwa vija viyafambule mila za Kiyahudi (Sula ya 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka iigala ng'hani na vitabu va Matayo na Maluko, kwavija vose vosimulila mbuli zizija mna inzila imoja. Mna ivitabu vose vidatu, Luka yaiyeka kasimulila ng'hani mbuli ya kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji. Vivija Luka kogangamiza ng'hani mbuli za kugela kumgongo (Sula za 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na kumpula Mulungu (Sula za 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 1:1-4, Luka koitambula Mbuli Inogile iyandike na kosimulila habali kayandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kosimulila kuvumbuka kwa Yesu na vivija viyaitandile kwa kusang'hana (Sula ya 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Hanhu hakulu ha Mbuli Inogile (Sula ya 4:14-21:38), Luka kosimulila sang'hano iyatendile Yesu, ng'hani ng'hani unzonza uyatendile na mbuli ziyafundize.</para>
  <para style="io">Kukimambukizo, sula za kabili za kimambukizo (Sula ya 22-24), kasimulila vija Yesu viyafile, viyazikigwe na viyazilibuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mkulu Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p">Wanhu wengi wawamba ng'hani kwandika mbuli zija zilawilile kumwetu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wandika mbuli zija zitulongeligwe na wanhu waja wazonile kwa meso gao kusongela kuna ichanduso na wapetile uusenga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Avo go mkulu, kwavija nizizahila vinogile mbuli zino kulawa kuna ichanduso, vinikona niye yokuwa vinoga kukwandikila goya mbuli zija zilawilile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Notenda vino muladi ujuwe ukweli wose wa mbuli ziufundizigwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji kopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kipindi acho Helode viyakalile mndewa wa Yudea, kukala na mulava nhosa, twaga jake Zakalia, wa kibumbila cha Abiya.<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fk">Abiya. </char> Walava nhosa waigola mna ivibumbila malongo mabili na nne, na Abiya kakala mulangulizi mna ikibumbila cha nane.</note> Mwehe wake kakala Elizabeti, nayo vivija kalawa mulukolo lwa mulava nhosa Haluni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wose wabili wakala wotenda ganogile mgameso ga Mulungu, na kugagoga Malagizo gose ga Mndewa Mulungu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wakala waduhu wana kwavija Elizabeti kakala mgumba, na wose wabili wakala wavele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Zakalia kakala Mng'anda ya Mulungu yosang'hana isang'hano yake ya kulava nhosa, kamba viyatendaga mna izamu yake. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Zakalia kasaguligwa kwa kubwanha simbi, kamba viwatendaga walava nhosa, kwingila Mng'anda ya Mndewa yasome ubani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kipindi cha kusoma ubani vikivikile, wanhu wengi wakala kunze wompula Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamulawilila Zakalia, kema mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa upango wa kusomela ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zakalia viyamone, kasinhuka na kagwaya kwa bwembwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini msenga wa kuulanga kamulongela, “Sekeudumbe, Zakalia! Mulungu kahulika kupula kwako. Mwehe wako Elizabeti kokulelela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake komkema Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kodeng'helela ng'hani na wanhu wengi wodeng'helela kwa kuvumbuka kwake. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kokuwa munhu mkulu mgameso ga Mndewa. Honda yang'we ugimbi hebu divai. Kokuwa na Loho Yang'alile kusongela mna iinda ya mamake. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kowatenda wanhu wengi wa Izilaeli wailumbe na Mndewa Mulungu wao. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nayo komulongolela Mndewa, kokuwa na nguvu kamba mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Eliya. Kowatenda tata na wana wainogele, kowagalusa wanhu waja hawamtegeleza Mulungu wagese ganogile kamba wanhu wanogile, avo yamtandile Mndewa wanhu zake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Zakalia kamuuza msenga ija wa kuulanga, “Vino nojuwaze mbuli ino kamba ya ukweli? Niye na mwehe wangu twa wavele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Msenga ija kamwidika, “Niye na Gabilieli. Nokwima haulongozi ha Mulungu, heyo ayo yanhumile nonge na gweye kukupetela mbuli ino inogile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini kwavija hutogole mbuli zangu zonda zilawilile mna ikipindi chake, sambi hudaha kulonga mbaka siku vonda ilawilile mbuli ino.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kipindi acho wanhu wakalile wombeta Zakalia, wakanganya habali kokawa kulawa Mng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Viyalawile kunze hadahile kulonga nao. Wajuwa hana kinhu cha unzonza kiyaonile Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kwavija kawagwaa kilaguso kwa kwinula makono gake, na kakala halonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Viyamambukize sang'hano yake Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kabwela ukae. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hamwande kidogo imwehe Elizabeti kagoga inda. Hasegele ukayake kwa miezi mitano. Kalonga, <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hakimambukizo Mndewa kanisegezela kinyala mgameso ga wanhu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu kopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Elizabeti viyakalile na inda ya miezi sita, Mulungu kamtuma msenga wa kuulanga, twaga jake Gabilieli, yachole kudibuga da Nazaleti, mwiisi ya Galilaya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kakala na usenga wa mhambe imoja yafungiligwe zengele na mbigalo imoja twaga jake Yusufu, yalawilile mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi. Mhambe ayo twaga jake Malia. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Msenga ija kamcholela Malia, kamulongela, “Zihoze! Mndewa kahamoja na gweye. Nayo kakunogela ng'hani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Malia viyauhulike usenga awo wa msenga wa kuulanga, kakala na mfundo ng'hani muumoyo wake, kakanganya usenga awo wofambula choni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Msenga ija kamulongela, “Malia, sekeudumbe, gweye kupata ng'hekewa ya Mulungu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kogoga inda na kolela mwana wa kimbigalo, nayo komkema Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kokuwa munhu mkulu, kokemigwa Mwana wa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani. Mndewa Mulungu komgwaa kigoda cha undewa, kamba viyakalile Daudi muhenga wake. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kokuwa mtawala wa lukolo lwa Yakobo siku zose, na undewa wake wokuwa wa mazuwa gose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Malia kamuuza msenga ija, “Niye na mhambe. Lelo mbuli ayo yokuwaze?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Msenga ija kamwidika, “Loho Yang'alile kokwizila, na nguvu za Mulungu zokugubika. Avo Mwana yonda yavumbuke kokuwa Yang'alile na kokemigwa Mwana wa Mulungu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kumbuka ndugu yako Elizabeti. Wanhu wakala wolonga kakala mgumba, lakini sambi kana inda ya miezi sita, hamoja na uvele uyalinao. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwavija kuduhu kinhu kimulemela Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Malia kalonga, “Niye na msang'hanaji wa Mndewa, nailawilile kumwangu kamba viulongile.” Abaho msenga ija kasegela.</para>
  <para style="s">Malia komtembelela Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kumwande kidogo Malia kafunga mwanza, kalopola kuchola kuna idibuga dili mvigongo va isi ya Yudea. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kengila mng'anda ya Zakalia, kamulamusa Elizabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elizabeti viyahulike Malia komulamusa, king'hele kili mna iinda yake kizumha. Nayo Elizabeti kamemezigwa Loho Yang'alile, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kalonga kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Gweye kunogeligwa kubanza watwanzi wose, na imwana yonda umulele konogeligwa! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Habali mbuli ino ng'hulu inilawilile niye, mbaka mama wa Mndewa wangu keza kunhembelela? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vimhulike kondamusa, mwana king'hele yeli mna iinda yangu kazumha kwa kudeng'helela. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kumweda gweye utogola usenga wa Mndewa, kwavija wolawilila kumwako!”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwila lwa Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Malia kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Moyo wangu womgwaa nhogolwa Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Loho yangu yomdeng'helela kwavija Mulungu Mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>kang'humbuka, niye msang'hanaji wake muhole!</para>
  <para style="q">Kulawa sambi wanhu wose wong'hema munhu yamwedile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>kwavija Mulungu Mkulu kanhendela vinhu vikulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Twaga jake ding'ala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kulawa lukolo na lukolo,</para>
  <para style="q">kowonela bazi wanhu wose womtegeleza.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Katenda mbuli ng'hulu kwa mkono wake.</para>
  <para style="q">Kawapwililisa wanhu weli na magoda mmizoyo yao.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawahumulusa wandewa mna ivigoda vao va undewa,</para>
  <para style="q">na kawenula wahole.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Weli na nzala kawatenda wegute kwa vinhu vinogile na</para>
  <para style="q">kawawinga matajili makono gaiyeka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kasang'hana kija kiyalongile kwa wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q">keza kumtaza msang'hanaji wake Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kakumbuka kumonela bazi Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q">na lukolo lwake lose siku zose!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Malia kakala kwa Elizabeti miezi midatu, abaho kabwela ukayake.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kipindi cha kuifungula Elizabeti vikivikile, kaifungula mwana wa kimbigalo. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Wanhu weli behi nayo na ndugu zake viwahulike mbuli ng'hulu ziyatendeligwe na Mndewa, wadeng'helela hamoja nayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Imwana viyavikize siku nane, wamwingiza kumbi. Walonda kumkema Zakalia, twaga da tatake, <verse number="60" style="v"/>lakini mamake kalonga, “Bule, twaga jake Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Wamulongela, “Kuduhu munhu mulukolo lwenu yeli na twaga dijo!” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Abaho wamgwaa kilaguso tatake, wamuuza twaga gani diyalondile mwanage yakemigwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Zakalia kawapula kibao cha kwandikila, kandika vino, “Twaga jake Yohana.” Wanhu wose wakanganya! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Bahaja Zakalia kadaha kulonga, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Wanhu weli behi nayo wadumba ng'hani. Mbuli izo za unzonza zibwililika kila hanhu kuvigongo va isi ya Yudea. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kila munhu yahulike mbuli ayo kaigelegeza, kauza, “Vino mwana ino kokuwa nani?” Kwavija udahi wa Mndewa ukala hamoja nayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Lwila lwa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Zakalia tatake Yohana kamemezigwa Loho Yang'alile, kalonga usenga wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Yatogoligwe Mndewa, Mulungu wa Izilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Keza kuwataza wanhu zake na kuwagombola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Katugwaa Mkombola yeli na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q">mzukulu wa Daudi msang'hanaji wake.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Kamba viyalongile toka mwaka kubitila watula ndagu zake wang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>kamba kotukombola na wanhu wang'hobo,</para>
  <para style="q">na kulawa mmakono ga wanhu watwihile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Kalonga kowonela bazi wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kokumbuka lagano jake ding'alile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Kaiduila kwa muhenga wetu Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>kutukombola mmakono ga wanhu watwihile,</para>
  <para style="q">na kututenda tumsang'hanile bila kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>tuwe wanhu wang'alile na wanhu wotenda goyolonda Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">siku zose za ugima wetu.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Gweye mwanangu, kokemigwa mtula ndagu wa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q">Komulongolela Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q">kuitanda nzila yake.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>Kowalongela wanhu zake kamba wokomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q">na nzambi zao zogeligwa kumgongo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Mulungu wetu kana bazi na moyo unogile.</para>
  <para style="q">Kotumwemwesela mulenge wa ukombozi kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>na wowamwemwesela wanhu wose wokala mdiziza da ifa,</para>
  <para style="q">na kulongoza magulu getu mnzila ya tindiwalo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Imwana ija kagendelela kukula lukuli na kawa na nguvu mwiiloho. Kakala kuluwala mbaka siku dija viyalawilile mgameso ga wanhu wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 1:18-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kipindi acho, Agusito, Mndewa wa Lumi, kalagiza wanhu wose mwiisi ya Lumi wapetigwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Awo ukala mwanza wa ichanduso wa wanhu kupetigwa kipindi Kilenio viyakalile mkulu wa isi ya Siliya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Avo kila munhu kachola kudibuga diyavumbuke kwandikigwa twaga jake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yusufu kasegela kudibuga da Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya, kachola kudibuga da Beselehemu mwiisi ya Yudea, hanhu hayavumbuke mndewa Daudi. Yusufu kachola kuko kwavija kolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kachola na Malia kupetigwa, yakalile yamfungile zengele. Nayo Malia kakala na inda. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Viwakalile kudibuga da Beselehemu, kipindi cha Malia kuifungula kivika. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kaifungula mwanage wa chaudele wa kimbigalo, kamvaza vikumbi. Abaho kamtambaliza hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe, kwavija hawapatile gati mzing'anda za wageni.</para>
  <para style="s">Wasusilaji wa ng'hondolo na wasenga wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kilo acho kukala na wasusilaji wa ng'hondolo mna imigunda ilibehi na Beselehemu, wakala wokaliza fugo zao.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Wasusilaji wokaliza fugo zao</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kawalawilila, ukulu wa Mndewa uwamwemwesela, nao wadumba ng'hani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini msenga ija kawalongela, “Sekemudumbe! Niye niwagalila mbuli inogile, mbuli yonda itende wanhu wose wadeng'helele. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lelo kudibuga da Daudi, Mkombola wenu kavumbuka, ayo Kilisito Mndewa! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kino acho kilaguso kumwenu, momvika mwana king'hele kavazigwa vikumbi, katambalizigwa hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bahaja bumbila kulu da wasenga wa kuulanga dilawilila, diilumba na msenga ija iyagwe, wamtogola Mulungu walonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Ukulu kwa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q">na tindiwalo diwe kwa wanhu wa mwiisi yawanogele!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wasenga wa kuulanga viwabwelile kuulanga, wasusilaji wailongela, “Tucholeni Beselehemu tukailole mbuli ino ilawilile, yailongile Mndewa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Avo walopola kuchola, wawavika Malia na Yusufu, na wamona imwana king'hele katambalizigwa hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wasusilaji viwamone imwana, wawalongela kija kiyawalongele msenga wa kuulanga mbuli ya imwana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wahulike kija kiwalongile wasusilaji, wakanganya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Malia kazika mbuli izo muumoyo na kazigelegeza ng'hani. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wasusilaji wabwela kuno wokwimba nyila za kumtogola Mulungu kwa mbuli zose ziwahulike na kuzona. Zose zilawilila kamba msenga wa kuulanga viyawalongele.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogweleligwa twaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mna isiku ya nane, siku ya kwingizigwa imwana kumbi, wamgwaa twaga da Yesu. Twaga ijo kagweleligwa na msenga wa kuulanga mamake hanagoga inda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa Mng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vikivikile kipindi cha kuisunha kamba Musa viyalagize mna Gamalagizo gake, Yusufu na Malia wamsola imwana na wachola nayo Yelusalemu muladi wamwike mgameso ga Mndewa, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kamba viyandikigwe mna Gamalagizo ga Mndewa, “Kila mwana wa chaudele wa kimbigalo yonda yavumbuke yagaligwe mgameso ga Mndewa.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vivija wachola kulava nhosa kamba malagizo ga Mndewa vigalondile, “Huwa wabili hebu makinda mabili ga njiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kipindi acho kukala na munhu yokala Yelusalemu, twaga jake Simeoni. Munhu ayo kakala yotenda goyolonda Mulungu na komdumba Mulungu. Vivija kakala yobetela ukombozi wa Izilaeli, na Loho Yang'alile kakala hamoja nayo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nayo Loho Yang'alile kamulongela honda yafe mbaka yamone Kilisito Mkombola. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Loho kamulongoza Simeoni yachole kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu. Abaho Yusufu na Malia wamgala imwana Yesu kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu wamtendele kamba Malagizo ga Musa vigalondile. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simeoni kamsola imwana mmakono gake, kamtogola Mulungu, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mndewa, sambi kusang'hana kamba viulongile,</para>
  <para style="q">muleke msang'hanaji wako yachole moyo uholile.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa meso gangu niuwona ukombozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ukombozi uutandile mgameso ga wanhu wose.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mulenge uwatenda wanhu haweli Wayahudi wajuwe goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q">na kugala ukulu kwa wanhu zako wa Izilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tatake na mamake imwana wakanganya kija kiyalongile Simeoni mbuli ya imwana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simeoni kawatambikila, kamulongela Malia, “Mwana ino kasaguligwa na Mulungu mbuli ya kupotela na kukomboligwa wanhu wengi wa Izilaeli. Nayo kokuwa kilaguso kulawa kwa Mulungu, na wanhu wengi womulema. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Abaho magesa ga wanhu wengi gogubuligwa. Na gweye mwenyego, usungu uli kamba panga dikutwa dousoma moyo wako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kukala na mgane imoja mtula ndagu wa Mulungu, yakalile mvele ng'hani, twaga jake Ana, biti Fanueli wa lukolo lwa Asheli. Mtwanzi ayo kakala na mkasano wake kwa miyaka saba toka yasoligwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nayo kakala mgane mbaka viyavikize miyaka malongo manane na nne. Kipindi chose acho kakala Mng'anda ya Mulungu imisi na ikilo, komgwaa ukulu Mulungu, kopula na kofunga kuja. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Saa iija kavika, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu na kalonga mbuli za imwana kwa wanhu wose wakalile wombeta Mulungu yaikombole Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yusufu na Malia viwamambukize kugatenda gaja gose galondeke na Malagizo ga Mndewa, wabwela kudibuga jao da Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Imwana kakula na kawa mbala goya, kakala yamemile nzewele, na ng'hekewa ya Mulungu ikala kumwake.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga Yesu Mng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kila mwaka tatake na mamake Yesu wacholaga Yelusalemu kuna inyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu viyavikize miyaka longo na mibili, wachola kuna inyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka kamba viwatendaga. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nyimwili nyimwili viimalile, wabwela ukae, lakini mbwanga Yesu kasigala Yelusalemu. Tatake na mamake hawajuwile bule. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wao viwagize kakala mna ikibumbila cha wanhu, avo watembela siku ngima. Abaho wasonga kumzahila Yesu mwa ndugu zao na mbwiga zao. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hawamone bule, avo wabweleganya Yelusalemu kumzahila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Siku ya kadatu wamvika kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kakala hamoja na wafundiza wa Kiyahudi, kowategeleza na kuwauza. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wamuhulike wakanganya nzewele zake na vija viyawedike. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tatake na mamake viwamone wasinhuka ng'hani. Mamake kamuuza, “Mwanangu, habali ututendile vino? Niye na tatako tukala moyo yungwayungwa tokuzahila gweye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Habali munizahila? Vino hamujuwile bule niye nilondeka ng'hale mng'anda ya Tatangu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini wao hawajuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola nao Nazaleti, ako kakala kowategeleza. Mamake kazika muumoyo mbuli zino zose. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kakula lukuli na ubala, kanogeligwa na Mulungu hamoja na wanhu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 3:1-12; Mlk 1:1-8; Yoh 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mwaka wa longo na tano muundewa wa mndewa wa Lumi yakemigwe Tibelio, Pontio Pilato kakala mkulu wa isi ya Yudea, na Helode kakala mkulu wa isi ya Galilaya, na Filipo mdodo wake kakala mkulu wa Itulea na isi ya Tulakoniti, na Lusania kakala mkulu wa isi ya Abilene, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Anasi na Kayafa wakala wakulu wa walava nhosa. Kipindi acho mbuli ya Mulungu imwizila Yohana mwanage Zakalia ako kuluwala <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yohana kachola mziisi zose zili mmabehi na lwanda lwa Yolidani, kawapetela wanhu, “Lekeni nzambi na mbatizigwe na Mulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zenu.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kamba viyandikigwe mna ikitabu cha mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Munhu kokema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q">goloseni nzila yonda yabite!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kila konde dimemezigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">kila kisugulu na kigongo visegezigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">nzila hazigoloke zigolosigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">na nzila zihile zotendigwa goya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wokona Mulungu kowakombola wanhu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela Yohana yawabatize. Yohana kawalongela, “Mweye mizoka! Nani yawalongele modaha kuikimbila nhaguso yonda igaligwe na Mulungu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Musang'hane gaja gonda galaguse muzileka nzambi zenu. Sekemuilongele, ‘Abulahamu ayo muhenga wetu.’ Nowalongela, Mulungu kodaha kugasola mabwe gano na kugatenda lukolo lwa Abulahamu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shoka ikigwa goya kukanha mibiki mna gamasina. Kila mbiki uleka kulela matunda ganogile wokanhigwa na kwasigwa muumoto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumuuza Yohana, “Avo tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yohana kawedika, “Munhu yoyose yeli na viwalo vibili yamgwee kimoja miyage yeliduhu, na ija yeli na lujo yatende vivo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wabokela kodi nao weza kubatizigwa. Wamuuza Yohana, “Mfundiza, tweye tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nayo kawalongela, “Sekemubokele kodi kubanza vija vimulagizigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wakalizi nao wamuuza, “Na tweye tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayo kawalongela, “Sekemumboke munhu yoyose sente yake hebu sekemumtaguse munhu yoyose kwa uvizi. Mutosheke na kija kimubokela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wanhu wakala wobetela kwiza kwa Mkombola, avo wasonga kuiuza mmizoyo yao kamba Yohana kodaha kuwa ayo Kilisito Mkombola. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yohana kawalongela wose, “Niye nowabatiza mweye kwa mazi, lakini kokwiza ija yeli munhu mkulu ng'hani kubanza niye. Niye sifaya hata kudohola nzabi za vilatu vake. Ayo kowabatiza kwa Loho Yang'alile na moto. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ayo kana lungo mmakono gake lwa kubetela uhule wake. Kowika uhemba kudikanho, lakini koisoma imikumvi muumoto haufaga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa mbuli nyingi Yohana kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile na kawalonda waleke nzambi zao. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Yohana kamkomhokela mndewa Helode, mkulu wa isi ya Galilaya kwavija kamsola Helodiya, mwehe wa mdodo wake, na katenda nzambi nyingi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Abaho Helode katenda dihile ng'hani kwa kumgodeka Yohana mkifungo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatizigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 3:13-17; Mlk 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wanhu wose viwakalile wobatizigwa, Yesu nayo kabatizigwa. Viyakalile kompula Mulungu, ulanga ugubuka, <verse number="22" style="v"/>na Loho Yang'alile kamuhulumukila mna ulukuli luigalile na huwa. Sauti ihulikigwa kulawa kuulanga, “Gweye kwa Mwanangu nikunogele. Ninogelwa na gweye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa lukolo luyavumbuke Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu viyasongile sang'hano yake, kakala na miyaka malongo madatu. Avo wanhu wagesa kakala mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Heli, <verse number="24" style="v"/>mwanage Matati, mwanage Lawi, mwanage Meliki, mwanage Yani, mwanage Yusufu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>mwanage Matatia, mwanage Amosi, mwanage Nahumu, mwanage Esili, mwanage Nagai, <verse number="26" style="v"/>mwanage Maati, mwanage Matatia, mwanage Semeni, mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Yuda, <verse number="27" style="v"/>mwanage Yoana, mwanage Lesa, mwanage Zelubabeli, mwanage Shealitieli, mwanage Neli, <verse number="28" style="v"/>mwanage Meliki, mwanage Adi, mwanage Kosamu, mwanage Elimadamu, mwanage Eli, <verse number="29" style="v"/>mwanage Yoshua, mwanage Eliezeli, mwanage Yolimu, mwanage Matati, mwanage Lawi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>mwanage Simeoni, mwanage Yuda, mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Yonamu, mwanage Eliakimu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>mwanage Melea, mwanage Mena, mwanage Matata, mwanage Natani, mwanage Daudi, <verse number="32" style="v"/>mwanage Yese, mwanage Obedi, mwanage Boazi, mwanage Salimoni, mwanage Nashoni, <verse number="33" style="v"/>mwanage Aminadabu, mwanage Adimini, mwanage Alini, mwanage Heziloni, mwanage Pelesi, mwanage Yuda, <verse number="34" style="v"/>mwanage Yakobo, mwanage Isaka, mwanage Abulahamu, mwanage Tela, mwanage Naholi, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mwanage Selugi, mwanage Lagau, mwanage Pelegi, mwanage Ebeli, mwanage Sela, <verse number="36" style="v"/>mwanage Kenani, mwanage Alifakisadi, mwanage Shemu, mwanage Nuhu, mwanage Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>mwanage Metusela, mwanage Henoko, mwanage Yaledi, mwanage Mahalaleli, mwanage Kenani, <verse number="38" style="v"/>mwanage Enoshi, mwanage Seti, mwanage Adamu, mwanage Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 4:1-11; Mlk 1:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kabwela kulawa Yolidani, kamema Loho Yang'alile na kalongozigwa na Loho Yang'alile mbaka kuluwala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ako kagezigwa na Mwenembago kwa ikipindi cha siku malongo mane. Mna ikipindi chose acho hadile kinhu chochose, avo vizimalile siku azo, nzala imuluma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamulongela Yesu, “Kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu, dilongele dibwe dino digaluke gate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Munhu hawa mgima kwa kuja kwiiyeka!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka uchanha ng'hani, kamulagusila undewa wose wa mwiisi kwa mwanza umoja. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwenembago kamulongela Yesu, “Nokugwaa ukulu na utajili wose uno, kwavija vose va mmakono gangu, na niye nodaha kumgwaa munhu yoyose inimulonda. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nokugwaa vinhu vose vino, kamba wahanitambikila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mtambikile Mndewa Mulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q">na umsang'hanile heyo yaiyeka!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu, kamwika uchanha ng'hani kuna ikiswili cha ing'anda ya Mulungu, abaho kamulongela Yesu, “Kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu, ilagaze mwenyego hasi kulawa hano. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mulungu kowalagiza wasenga zake</para>
  <para style="q">wa kuulanga wakukalize!’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na vivija golonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Wokupapa mmakono gao,</para>
  <para style="q">sekeuilumize magulu gako mgamabwe!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Sekeumgeze Mndewa Mulungu wako!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwenembago viyamambukize kumgeza Yesu kwa kila nzila, kamuleka mbaka kipindi kiyagwe kinogile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosonga sang'hano yake ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 4:12-17; Mlk 1:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kabwela isi ya Galilaya, nguvu ya Loho Yang'alile ikala hamoja nayo. Mbuli zake zibwililika mziisi zose za mmabehi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kakala yofundiza mna zing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na kila munhu kamgwaa nhogolwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:53-58; Mlk 6:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola Nazaleti, hanhu kuyakulile. Mna isiku ya Kubwihila, kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu kamba viyatendaga. Kema yasome Maandiko Gang'alile. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kagweleligwa kitabu cha mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Isaya, kakifungula na kona hanhu handikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Loho wa Mndewa Mulungu kamgati mmwangu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija kanisagula niwagalile wanhu wakiwa Mbuli Inogile.</para>
  <para style="q">Kanituma niwapetele wagodekigwe kamba wolekesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q">na waja wasuwameso walole,</para>
  <para style="q">na kuwakombola waja wadununzigwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>na kuwalongela kamba saa ivika</para>
  <para style="q">ya Mndewa kuwakombola wanhu zake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kakigubika ikitabu, kakibweza kwa msang'hanaji, abaho kakala hasi. Wanhu wose wakalile mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu wamulola Yesu bunhuu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nayo kasonga kuwalongela, “Chandikigwe muno, lelo kilawilila kamba vimuhulike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wose wamtogola na wakanganya mbuli zake zinogile ziyalongile. Walonga, “Vino ino siyo mwanage Yusufu?.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nojuwa monongela ulonzi uno, ‘Mganga, ihonye mwenyego! Gose gatuhulike kugatenda ako Kapelinaumu, vivija gatende na hano ukayako.’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, kuduhu mtula ndagu yotegelezigwa ukayake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nhegelezeni, ona kukala na wagane wengi mwiisi ya Izilaeli mna ikipindi cha Eliya. Kipindi acho, mvula haitowile miyaka midatu na nusu, kukala na lufilili lwa nzala mwiisi yose. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini Eliya hatumigwe bule kwa munhu yoyose iyagwe mwiisi ya Izilaeli, ila kwa mgane imoja yakalile Selepata, mwiisi ya Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vivija mna ikipindi cha mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Elisha, kukala na wanhu wengi wakalile wolumwa utamu wa dikulu mwiisi ya Izilaeli. Lakini kuduhu munhu yoyose iyagwe yahonyigwe, ila Naamani yaiyeka, munhu wa isi ya Siliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu wagevuzika ng'hani viwahulike avo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wenuka, wamulava kunze kudibuga jao dizengigwe uchanha kukigongo, wamgala mbaka mwiingema ya kigongo acho, walonda kumpigisa hasi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kabita hagati ya lunhu luja, kalawanya.</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 1:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola kudibuga da Kapelinaumu mwiisi ya Galilaya. Mwiisiku ya Kubwihila, kakala yofundiza wanhu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mafundizo gake gawakanganya wanhu wose, kwavija kakala kolonga kwa udahi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu kukala na munhu yeli na kinyamkela. Kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Oii! Kolonda kututenda choni, Yesu wa Nazaleti? Vino kwiza kutukoma? Nokujuwa, Gweye kwa ija Yang'alile wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela ija, “Nyamala! Mulawe munhu ino!” Kinyamkela kambwanha hasi munhu ija mgameso gao, abaho kamulawa bila kumulumiza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani na wailongela, “Mbuli gani zino? Munhu ino kana nguvu na udahi wa kuwakomhokela vinyamkela, nao womtegeleza!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Avo mbuli za Yesu zibwililika kila hanhu mwiisi ija.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:14-17; Mlk 1:29-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kalawa kuna ing'anda ya kumpula Mulungu, kachola ukayake Simoni. Mkwe wa kitwanzi wa Simoni kakala yolumwa homa ng'hali, avo wamulongela Yesu yamuhonye. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kamcholela, kema behi na lusazi lwa mtwanzi ayo, kaikomhokela homa imulawe. Homa imulawa, bahaja mtwanzi ija kenuka, kasonga kuwasang'hanila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Zuwa vidihongile, wanhu wose wakalile na watamu wawagala kwa Yesu, nayo keka makono gake uchanha mwa kila munhu na kuwahonya wose. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vinyamkela wawalawa wanhu wengi na kuguta, “Gweye kwa mwana wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawakomhokela na kawagomesa kulonga, kwavija wamjuwa kamba kakala Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 1:35-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Imitondo yake, Yesu kasegela kudibuga, kachola hanhu kuduhu wanhu. Wanhu wasonga kumzahila, na viwamone, walonda kumgomesa sekeyachole. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Vivija nolondeka kuwapetela wanhu wa mmabuga gayagwe Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Mulungu, kwavija acho kiyanhumile Mulungu kukisang'hana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Avo kawapetela wanhu mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu mwiisi yose ya Yudea.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wanahina wa ichanduso</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 4:18-22; Mlk 1:16-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala yemile mumgwazo wa lamba da Genesaleti. Wanhu wengi wakala woisung'ha sung'ha wategeleza mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kazona ngalawa mbili zikalile mwiingema ya lamba, zilekigwe na wavuwa somba, wakalile wosunha mizavu yao. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kengila mwiingalawa imoja ikalile ya Simoni, kamulonda Simoni yaikwese mgamazi. Abaho Yesu kakala mwiingalawa, kafundiza lunhu luja.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Viyamambukize kufundiza, kamulongela Simoni, “Kwesa ingalawa mbaka kuna gamazi mengi, abaho gweye na wayago mupigise mizavu yenu muvuwe somba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Go mkulu, tusang'hana ng'hani kilo kigima lakini hatupatile kinhu bule. Lakini kamba gweye kolonga avo, nogela mizavu yangu mgamazi.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wapigisa mizavu yao, somba wengi wanamata mbaka mizavu yao ilonda kudegeka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Avo wawakema wayao wakalile mwiingalawa iyagwe weze kuwataza. Wayao weza na wazimemeza ngalawa zose mbili, zose zikala zimemile somba mbaka zilonda kudidimila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo viyachonile kija kilawilile, kamfugamila Yesu mmagulu, kalonga, “Mndewa, segela haulongozi wangu, niye nimema nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni na wayage wakanganya ng'hani mbuli ya somba wengi wawapatile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vivija wayage Simoni, Yakobo na Yohana, wanage Zebedayo, nao wakanganya. Yesu kamulongela Simoni, “Sekeudumbe. Kulawa sambi kokuwa mvuwaji wa wanhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wazilava ngalawa zao kunze mumgwazo, wavileka vinhu vose, wamkweleleza Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yeli na dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:1-4; Mlk 1:40-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kudibuga dimoja, kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. Viyamonile Yesu, kaibwanha hasi, kampula, “Go mkulu, wahalonda, kodaha kunihonya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kagolosa mkono wake, kamkwasa. Kalonga, “Nolonda, hona!” Bahaja utamu wa dikulu umulawa munhu ija. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamulagiza, “Sekeumulongele munhu yoyose, lakini goga inzila mbaka kwa mulava nhosa ukailaguse, abaho kalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa ili kutenda kila munhu yatogole kamba kuhonyigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini mbuli za Yesu zibwililika kila hanhu. Wanhu wengi weza kumtegeleza na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kacholaga hanhu kuduhu wanhu na kampula Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:1-8; Mlk 2:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu viyakalile kofundiza, Mafalisayo wayagwe na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala aho. Wakala walawile kila buga mwiisi ya Galilaya na Yudea na kulawa Yelusalemu. Nguvu ya Mndewa ikala hamoja na Yesu kuwahonya watamu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe weza kuno wampapa mulusazi munhu yaholole. Wageza kumwingiza mng'anda wamwike haulongozi wa Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini hawapatile nzila ya kumwingiza mng'anda, kwavija kukala na lunhu lwa wanhu. Avo wamsola mtamu wao, wamgala uchanha kukiswili, watobola zonzo. Abaho wamuhumulusa na lusazi lwake mbaka hagati ya lunhu lwa wanhu, wamwika haulongozi wa Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Wanhu wane womuhumulusa munhu kukiswili</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu viyone kutamanila kwao, kamulongela munhu ija, “Mbwigangu, nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kuiuza, “Munhu gani ino kolonga mbuli za kumuliga Mulungu? Mulungu yaiyeka ayo yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kajuwa viwagesile, avo kawalongela, “Habali mogesa avo? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Choni kibuhile, kulonga, ‘Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo,’ hebu kulonga, ‘Ima utembele’? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe kamba Mwana wa Munhu kana udahi mwiisi wa kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.” Abaho kamulongela munhu ija yaholole, “Nokulongela, ima, papa lusazi lwako, uchole ukayako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bahaja munhu ija kenuka mgameso ga wanhu, kapapa lusazi lwake mumo muyatambalale, kachola ukayake kuno komtogola Mulungu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani na kudumba! Wamtogola Mulungu walonga, “Lelo tona unzonza!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:9-13; Mlk 2:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kachola na kamona mbokela kodi yakemigwe Lawi kakala mng'anda ya kusolela kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lawi kenuka, kaleka kila kinhu, kamkweleleza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Abaho Lawi kamtendela Yesu nyimwili nyimwili ng'hulu ukayake. Vivija kukala na wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wayagwe wagonekigwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile aho wawauza wanahina wa Yesu, “Habali moja na kung'wa hamoja na wabokela kodi na wanhu wotenda nzambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wanhu wagima hawalonda mganga, lakini waja weli watamu womulonda mganga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Sizile kuwakema wanhu wogesa wanoga, lakini niza kuwakema waja wene nzambi waleke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:14-17; Mlk 2:18-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamulongela Yesu, “Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizaji wofunga kuja miyanza mingi na kumpula Mulungu, na wanahina wa Mafalisayo wotenda vivo, lakini wanahina zako woja na kung'wa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mogesa wanhu wagonekigwe kuna idizengele wodaha kufunga kuja kipindi munhu yosola kahamoja nao? Havidahika bule! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lakini kipindi chokwiza, munhu yosola vonda yasegezigwe kumwao, baho wofunga kuja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Kuduhu munhu yokanha kilaka mkiwalo cha sambi na kukika mkiwalo cha umwaka. Yahatenda avo, kokinanga kija kiwalo cha sambi, na kilaka acho honda kiigale na kiwalo cha umwaka. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vivija kuduhu munhu yogida divai ya sambi mna mifuko ya ng'hwembe ya umwaka. Kwavija yahatenda avo, divai ya sambi yoitula mifuko ayo ya umwaka, divai yokwitika, na mifuko yobanangika. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Divai ya sambi yogidigwa mmifuko ya ng'hwembe ya sambi! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuduhu munhu yolonda divai ya sambi yahamambukiza kung'wa ya umwaka. Kwavija kolonga, ‘Ya umwaka inoga ng'hani.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:1-8; Mlk 2:23-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mna isiku imoja ya Kubwihila, Yesu kakala yobita mmigunda ya uhemba. Wanahina zake wasonga kubena mikungwi ya uhemba, wagafigisa mmakono gao na kuja mhule zake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wawauza, “Habali motenda kinhu kigomesigwe mna isiku ya Kubwihila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mweye hamusomile kija kiyatendile Daudi na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daudi kengila Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kasola magate galavigwe kwa Mulungu, kagaja na vivija kawagwaa wayage. Malagizo gawagomesa wanhu wayagwe kuja magate gago ila kwa walava nhosa waiyeka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamambukiza kwa kulonga, “Mwana wa Munhu ayo Mndewa wa siku ya Kubwihila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole mkono</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:9-14; Mlk 3:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna isiku iyagwe ya Kubwihila, Yesu kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu na kafundiza. Baho kukala na munhu imoja, mkono wake wa kudila ukala uholole. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wayagwe wakala wozahila kilamuso cha kumtagusa Yesu, avo wakala womulola wamone kamba komuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawajuwa viwagesile, kamulongela munhu ija yaholole mkono, “Ima wize hano haulongozi.” Munhu ija kenuka na kwima hagati. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Nowauza, vino Malagizo getu gotulonda tutende choni mwiisiku ya Kubwihila? Kutenda ganogile hebu kutenda gehile? Kuhonya ugima wa munhu hebu kuukoma?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola wanhu wose wakalile aho, abaho kamulongela munhu ija, “Golosa mkono wako.” Munhu ija katenda avo, na mkono wake uhona kabili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu wagevuzika ng'hani na wasonga kuilongela wamtende choni Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:1-4; Mlk 3:13-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kipindi kija Yesu kachola kuna ikigongo kumpula Mulungu, kakala ako kilo kigima kompula Mulungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imitondo yake, kawakema wanahina zake, kawasagula longo na wabili mna idibumbila jao, kawagwaa twaga da watumigwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Watumigwa awo wakala Simoni, ayo Yesu kamkema Petulo na Andeleya mdodo wake, Yakobo na Yohana, Filipo na Batulumayo, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo mwanage Alufayo na Simoni yakemigwe Zelote, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yuda mwanage Yakobo na Yuda Isikaliote yamuhinduke Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza na kuhonya wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 4:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu viyahumuluke kukigongo hamoja na watumigwa zake, kema hanhu hagoloke hamoja na wanahina zake wengi. Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lukala aho kulawa isi yose ya Yudea na buga da Yelusalemu, na kulawa mhwani ya isi za Tilo na Sidoni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Weza kumtegeleza Yesu na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao. Vivija wanhu waja wakalile wogazigwa na vinyamkela weza na wahonyigwa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wageza kumkwasa Yesu, kwavija nguvu ya kuhonya ikala ilawa kumwake na kuwahonya wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Kudeng'helela na kunyunyuwala</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 5:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawalola wanahina zake, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mmweda mweye muli wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu uli wenu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mmweda mweye muli na nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija mokwiguta!</para>
  <para style="q">Mmweda mweye mulila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija modeng'helela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mmweda mweye kamba wanhu womwihilani, wowalema, wowaliga na kuwalonga vihile kwa mbuli ya Mwana wa Munhu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Deng'heleleni na kuvina vonda galawilile, kwavija mwikiligwa nhunza ng'hulu kuulanga. Kwavija vivo wahenga zao viwawatendele watula ndagu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini mogaya mweye muli matajili sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija mmala kupata deng'ho jenu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mogaya mweye mwigute sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija mokona nzala!</para>
  <para style="q">Mogaya mweye museka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q">kwavija moiyalala na kulila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mogaya mweye kamba wanhu wose wowagwaa nhogolwa kwavija wahenga zao vivija wawatendela vivo watula ndagu wa uvizi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwanogela wakwihile</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 5:38-48; Mat 7:12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Lakini nowalongela mweye munitegeleza, wanogeleni wamwihileni, muwatendele ganogile waja wowatendela gehile. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muwatambikile waja wowaduila, na muwapulile kwa Mulungu waja womonelani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Munhu yonda yakutowe kanza dimoja, muleke yakutowe kanza diyagwe vivija, kamba munhu kokuboka koti jako, muleke yasole na shati jako vivija. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Munhu yahakupula kinhu mgwee, na munhu yokuboka vinhu vako, sekeulonde yakubwezele. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Avo watendeleni wayagwe gaja gose gomulonda mweye kutendeligwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kamba mweye mowanogela wanhu wowanogela mweye waiyeka, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi wowanogela waja wowanogela hewo! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na kamba mowatendela ganogile waja wowatendela ganogile waiyeka, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi wotenda vivo! <verse number="34" style="v"/>Na kamba mowakopesha waja waiyeka mutamanila wodaha kuwabwezela, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi wowakopesha wayao wotamanila wodaha kuwabwezela kikija kiwawakopeshe! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lakini mweye wanogeleni waja womwihileni na muwatendele ganogile, muwakopeshe wanhu bila kutamanila kubwelezeligwa. Abaho nhunza yenu yokuwa ng'hulu, na mweye mokuwa wana wa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani. Kwavija heyo kanoga kwa waja weliduhu nhogolwa kumwake na wanhu wotenda nzambi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muwe na bazi kamba vija Tata yenu viyeli na bazi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatagusa wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 7:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Sekemuwataguse wayagwe, Mulungu honda yawataguse mweye. Sekemuwalaumu wayagwe, na Mulungu honda yawalaumu mweye. Mugele kumgongo nzambi za wanhu wayagwe, na Mulungu kogela kumgongo nzambi zenu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Muwagwee wayagwe, na Mulungu kowagwaa mweye. Na mweye mobokela kibaba kimemile na kusindiligwa mbaka vokwitika mmakono genu, na vose vonda mudahe kuvigoga. Avo, vija vimuwapimila wayagwe, Mulungu nayo kowapimila vivo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Msuwameso hadaha kumulongoza msuwameso miyage. Yahatenda vivo, wose wabili wolagalila mdikolombo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuduhu mwanahina yombanza mfundiza wake. Lakini kila mwanahina yahamambukiza mafunzo gake, koigala na mfundiza wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Habali kolola kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako lakini hulola biki dili mdisiso jako? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hebu kodahaze kumulongela ndugu yako, ‘Chonde, leka nikulave kibanzi kili mdisiso jako,’ kuno gweye ung'hali hunajona biki dili mdisiso jako mwenyego? Gweye kwa mnafiki! Tanhu lava biki dili mdisiso jako, abaho kodaha kulola goya na kulava kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na matunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 7:16-20; Mat 12:33-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mbiki unogile haudaha kulela matunda gehile, hebu mbiki wihile haudaha kulela matunda ganogile. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kila mbiki wojuwika kwa matunda gake goulela, kwavija hudaha kubawa ngama mumkese hebu kubawa fulu kuna ivisolo va miba. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Munhu yanogile kolava ganogile mwiingama yake inogile ili muumoyo wake, lakini munhu yehile kolava gehile mwiingama yake ihile ili muumoyo wake. Kwavija munhu kolonga gaja gamemile muumoyo wake.</para>
  <para style="s">Wazengaji wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 7:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Habali monikema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa,’ kuno hamugatenda gaja goniwalongela? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yokwiza kumwangu na kutegeleza mbuli zangu na kuzigoga nowalagusila kaigala na choni. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kaigala na munhu yozenga ng'anda yake yahimbile hasi ng'hani, keka chandusilo chake mdibwe. Mvula ng'hulu viitowile, mazi gaitowa ing'anda, lakini hagadahile kuitigisa kwavija ikala izengigwe goya. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yotegeleza mbuli zangu na kolema kuzigoga, kaigala na munhu yazengile ng'anda yake bila kuhimba chandusilo. Mvula ng'hulu viitowile, mazi gaitowa ng'anda ija, nayo igwa na kubanangika!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msang'hanaji wa mkulu imoja wa wakalizi wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:5-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwafundiza wanhu, kachola Kapelinaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ako kukala na mkulu imoja wa wakalizi gana wa Kilumi yakalile na msang'hanaji wake mtamu ng'hani, na kalonda kufa. Nayo mkulu ayo kakala yomnogela ng'hani msang'hanaji ayo.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Mkulu wa wakalizi gana wa Kilumi</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mkulu ayo viyahulike mbuli za Yesu, kawatuma wavele wayagwe wa Wayahudi wampule Yesu yeze kumuhonya msang'hanaji wake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Avo wamcholela Yesu, wampula ng'hani, wamulongela, “Munhu ino kofaya umtaze. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kowanogela wanhu na vivija katuzengela ng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Avo Yesu kachola nao. Viyakalile behi na ng'anda ya mkulu ija, mkulu ija kawatuma mbwiga zake wamulongele Yesu, “Go mkulu, sekeuigaze kwiza ukae, kwavija niye sifaya gweye wingile mng'anda yangu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>vivija niiyona sifaya hata kwiza kumwako. Lakini longa mbuli iiyeka, na msang'hanaji wangu kohona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwavija naniye vivija na hasi ya udahi wa wakulu na nina wakalizi hasi yangu. Nahamulongela ino, ‘Chola!’ nayo kochola, nahamulongela iyagwe, ‘Izo!’ nayo kokwiza, vivija nahamulongela msang'hanaji wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ nayo kotenda vivo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu viyahulike avo kakanganya ng'hani, kahinduka, kalulongela lunhu lwa wanhu lukalile lomkweleleza, “Nowalongela, sinamona munhu yeli na tamanilo kulu kamba dino, hata mwiisi ya Izilaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wanhu waja watumigwe wabwela kuna ing'anda ya mkulu ija, wamvika msang'hanaji ija kahona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula mwana wa mgane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kumwande, Yesu kachola kudibuga dimoja dikemigwe Naini. Kailongoza na wanahina zake na lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Viyakalile habehi na ulwivi mkulu wa kwingilila kudibuga dijo, wanhu wapapile maiti ga mbwanga wakala wolawa kunze kudibuga, wochola kuzika. Mbwanga ayo yafile kakala mwana yeli yaiyeka wa mtwanzi yakalile mgane. Wanhu wengi wa buga ijo wakala hamoja na mtwanzi ayo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mndewa Yesu viyamone mtwanzi ayo, kamonela bazi, kamulongela, “Sekeulile.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Abaho kagenda, kalukwasa ulusazi luwaitambalize maiti ya mbwanga ija. Wanhu walupapile ulusazi luja wema. Yesu kalonga, “Mbwanga! Nokulongela, lamuka.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mbwanga ija yafile kalamuka, kasonga kulonga. Abaho Yesu kamgwaa mama ija mwanage.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wengila bwembwe na wamtogola Mulungu. Walonga, “Mtula ndagu mkulu wa Mulungu katulawilila hamwetu! Mulungu keza kuwakombola wanhu zake!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mbuli zino za Yesu zenela mwiisi yose ya Yudea na isi zili mmabehi.</para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 11:2-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wanahina zake Yohana Mbatizaji wamulongela Yohana mbuli zose zino. Nayo kawakema wanahina zake wabili mna iwanahina zake, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kawatuma wachole kwa Mndewa wakamuuze, “Vino gweye ayo ija iyalongile Yohana Mbatizaji kokwiza, hebu tumbete iyagwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamulongela, “Yohana Mbatizaji katutuma tukuuze, kamba gweye ayo ija yalongile kokwiza, hebu tumbete iyagwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kipindi kikija Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi wakalile watamu, wakalile wogaya, wakalile na vinyamkela na kawatenda wanhu wengi wakalile wasuwameso walole. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Avo Yesu kawedika, “Bweleni mkamulongele Yohana gaja gomuhulika na kugona, wasuwameso wolola, mbetembete wotembela, na weli na utamu wa dikulu wohonyigwa, na wanhu hawahulika wohulika, wafile wozilibuka, na wakiwa wopeteligwa Mbuli Inogile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kamweda munhu ija yeliduhu shaka na niye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwasegele, Yesu kasonga kululongela lunhu luja mbuli ya Yohana, “Vino vimucholile kuluwala, muchola kulola choni? Muchola kulola lusanze vilutigisigwa na beho? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vino muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola munhu yavalile viwalo vinogile? Wanhu iwovala viwalo vinogile, weli na ugima wa kubwihila wokala mzing'anda za wandewa! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nongeleni, vino muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola mtula ndagu wa Mulungu? Ona, lakini mona vingi ng'hani kubanza mtula ndagu wa Mulungu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwavija Yohana ayo yalongigwe mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Mulungu kalonga, nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele, yaitande nzila yako.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Nowalongela, Yohana ni munhu mkulu kubanza munhu yoyose yakalile mwiisi. Lakini yeli mdodo Muundewa wa Mulungu ni munhu mkulu kubanza Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wamuhulike, hata wabokela kodi, wamtogola Mulungu kamba kanoga na wakala wabatizigwe na Yohana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa walema kutenda ga Mulungu, kwavija walema kubatizigwa na Yohana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino niwasimulile kwa lusimo gani wanhu wa lukolo luno? Vino waigala na choni? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Waigala na wana wadodo wakalile mdigulilo. Kibumbila kimoja chokikemelela kibumbila kiyagwe, ‘Tuwatowela gombe sugu, lakini hamuvinile bule! Tuwembila nyila za kuindilo, lakini hamulilile bule!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yohana Mbatizaji keza, kafunga kuja na hang'wile divai, mweye mulonga, ‘Kana kinyamkela!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwana wa Munhu keza, kaja na kung'wa, mweye mulonga, ‘Muloleni munhu ino! Mmelo na mulevi, mbwiga wa wabokela kodi na wanhu waja wotenda nzambi!’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lakini nzewele ya Mulungu yokoneka inoga kwa wanhu waja wose woitogola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ukayake Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mfalisayo imoja kamgoneka Yesu yakaje nayo lujo lwa ichungulo. Avo Yesu kachola kuna ing'anda ya Mfalisayo, kakala na kuja. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kudibuga dija kukala na mtwanzi imoja yakalile yotenda nzambi. Kahulika kamba Yesu kakala yoja mng'anda ya Mfalisayo ayo, avo kasola nyhupa ya alabasita imemile mavuta gonung'hila goya ga bei ng'hulu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kema kukisogo, habehi na magulu ga Yesu kolila, mahozi gake galagalila mgamagulu ga Yesu. Abaho kagahangusa magulu ga Yesu kwa mvili zake, kaganonela na kagagidila mavuta. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mfalisayo ija viyone avo, kailongela, “Maza munhu ino yakalile mtula ndagu wa Mulungu, yahamjuwile mtwanzi ino yomgoga kavilihi, yahamjuwile kamema nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Simoni, nina mbuli ya kukulongela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni kalonga, “Ona, Mfundiza, nongela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kasonga kumulongela, “Kukala na wanhu wabili wakopile sente kwa munhu yokopesha sente. Imoja kakopa sente magana matano, na iyagwe kakopa malongo matano. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wose wabili hawadahile kumulipa, avo munhu ija kawalekelela wose. Vino nani mna iwanhu waja yonda yamnogele ng'hani munhu ija?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Vinikona niye kokuwa ija yalekeleligwe sente nyingi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kalonga, “Kulonga goya.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Abaho kamuhindukila mtwanzi ija na kamulongela Simoni, “Komona mtwanzi ino? Niza kuna ikae yako, hungwelele mazi ga kusunha magulu gangu, lakini mtwanzi ino kagasunha magulu gangu kwa mahozi gake na kagahangusa kwa mvili zake. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gweye hunibokele kwa kuninonela, lakini mtwanzi ino halekile kuganonela magulu gangu tangu vinizile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hunibakile pala jangu mavuta, lakini mtwanzi ino kambakaza magulu gangu mavuta gonung'hila goya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nokulongela, nzambi zake nyingi zigeligwa kumgongo, lekaavo kalagusa unogelwa mkulu. Lakini munhu yoyose yeli na nzambi kidogo zigeligwe kumgongo, kolagusa unogelwa mdodo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ija, “Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile hamoja na Yesu muulujo, wasonga kuilongela, “Ino munhu gani yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ija, “Kutamanila kwako kukukombola. Genda moyo uholile.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Watwanzi wacholile na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hamwande Yesu kafunga mwanza, kabitila mna gamabuga na vijiji kowapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Mulungu. Wanahina zake longo na wabili wachola nayo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Watwanzi wayagwe wakalile walavigwe vinyamkela na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao vivija wamkweleleza. Watwanzi awo wakala Malia, yakemigwe Magidalena, ija yalavigwe vinyamkela saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yoana mwehe wake Kuza yakalile msang'hanaji mkulu mna ikae ya mndewa Helode, na Suzana, na watwanzi wayagwe wengi. Watwanzi awo wakala wosola vinhu vao na kuwataza Yesu na wanahina zake.</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa muhandaji</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:1-9; Mlk 4:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wanhu wagendelela kwiza kwa Yesu kulawa kila buga. Lunhu mkulu viluitig'hane hamoja, Yesu kalulongela lusimo luno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Kukala na munhu kachola kuhanda mbeyu mumgunda wake. Viyakalile komiza izimbeyu, mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, wanhu wazibojoga, na ndege wazija. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mdibwe hali na udongo kidogo. Vizotile, zinyala kwavija udongo ukala waduhu unyefu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mna ivisolo va miba. Miba ikula na izizonga zimbeyu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mna udongo unogile. Zikula na kulela mbeyu nyingi kubanza zija zihandigwe, kila mbeyu ilela miyanza malongo longo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu viyalongile avo, kalonga kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Munhu yeli na magwiti, yahulike!”</para>
  <para style="s">Simo zotufunza choni</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:10-17; Mlk 4:10-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wanahina zake Yesu wamuuza fambulo da lusimo luno. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mutendigwa kuzijuwa mbuli zifisigwe za Undewa wa Mulungu. Lakini kwa wanhu wayagwe, nolonga kwa simo, muladi walole lakini sekewone, na wategeleze lakini sekewajuwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa muhandaji</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:18-23; Mlk 4:13-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Dino ijo fambulo da muhandaji, mbeyu ni mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zija zilagalile mnzila zolagusa wanhu waja iwohulika mbuli ya Mulungu, lakini Mwenembago kokwiza na kuisola mbuli ayo mmizoyo yao muladi waleke kutogola na kukomboligwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mdibwe zolagusa wanhu waja wohulika mbuli ya Mulungu na kuibokela kwa kudeng'helela, lakini mbuli ayo haika mizizi mgati mmwao. Woitogola kwa kipindi kidodo, lakini wahagezigwa woileka mbuli ayo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mvisolo va miba zolagusa wanhu waja wohulika mbuli ya Mulungu, lakini viwogendelela, Mbuli ayo yozongigwa zongigwa na magayo, na utajili, na kudeng'helela vinhu va mwiisi. Wanhu awo hawalela bule matunda gonda gakangale. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini mbeyu zilagalile hali na udongo unogile zolagusa wanhu waja iwohulika mbuli ya Mulungu na kuika mmizoyo yao na kuitogola, wofunga umoyo mbaka wolela matunda.</para>
  <para style="s">Taa kigubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 4:21-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Wanhu hawabwinha taa kuigubika na kikalango hebu kuika muuvungu wa lusazi. Lakini woika hana ikingolobweda, muladi wanhu viwokwingila wone mulenge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Kinhu chochose kifisigwe chokwikigwa hanhu hazelu, na kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chojuwika na kugaligwa hana umulenge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Avo muiteganye na gaja gomuhulika, kwavija munhu yeli na kinhu kokongezeligwa, lakini ija yeliduhu kinhu kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyogesa kanacho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:46-50; Mlk 3:31-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu wamcholela, lakini hawadahile kumvikila habehi mbuli ya lunhu lwa wanhu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Munhu imoja kamulongela Yesu, “Mamako na ndugu zako wema kunze, wolonda kukona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu wose, “Mamangu na ndugu zangu ni waja woihulika mbuli ya Mulungu na kuitenda.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodihoza beho kulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:23-27; Mlk 4:35-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakwela mwiingalawa hamoja na wanahina zake, kawalongela, “Tuloke umwambu.” Avo wasonga umwanza. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Viwakalile muumwanza, Yesu kawasa. Bahaja nyukwanyukwa da beho disonga kubuma mna idilamba, na ngalawa isonga kumema mazi, avo wose wakala mdizumozumo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wanahina wamgendela Yesu wamulamusa, wamulongela, “Go mkulu! Go mkulu! Tofa!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kalamuka, kadikomhokela beho na ng'humbi ya mazi. Vose vinyamala na kukala tuluu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tamanilo jenu da kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini awo wakanganya na kudumba, wailongela, “Ino munhu gani? Kodikomhokela beho na ng'humbi, navo vomuhulka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulava munhu vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:28-34; Mlk 5:1-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika kuna imhwani ya isi ya Wagelasi, muumwambu wa lamba kulawa Galilaya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Viyahumuluke mwiingalawa, kamting'hana munhu imoja yeli na vinyamkela, yalawile kudibuga. Miyaka mingi munhu ayo kakala havala kiwalo wala hasinya ukayake, lakini kakala yokala kuna gamapanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Viyamone Yesu, kaibwanha mmagulu ga Yesu, kaguta mizangi yolonga, “Gweye Yesu! Mwana wa Mulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani! Kolonda kunitenda choni? Nokupula, sekeunidununze!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kalonga avo kwavija Yesu kakala yamulagize ikinyamkela yamulawe munhu ayo. Miyanza mingi kinyamkela ayo kakala yomkumba munhu ayo. Hamoja wanhu wakala womgodeka mng'anda kuno makono gake na magulu gake gagodekigwa minyololo na mhingu, lakini kakala yokanha, na kinyamkela ayo kakala yomkimbiza mbaka kuluwala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza munhu ija, “Twaga jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kamwidika, “Twaga jangu Lunhu.” Kalonga avo kwavija vinyamkela wengi wakala wamkumbile. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vinyamkela waja wampula Yesu sekeyawagale kuna dikolombo dikulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Habehi na aho kukala na bumbila kulu da nguluwe wakalile woja kukigongo. Avo vinyamkela wampula Yesu yawatogolele wawakumbe nguluwe. Yesu kawatogolela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vinyamkela wamulawa munhu ija, wawengila nguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe dihumulukila mwiingema ya idilamba, wengila mdilamba, wose wafa mgamazi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile wowadima nguluwe awo wachona acho kilawilile, wakimbila na wazibwililisa mbuli azo kudibuga na mvijiji. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wanhu wachola kulola kija kilawilile. Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamona munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kakala mmagulu ga Yesu, kavala viwalo, kana nzewele zake. Wanhu wose wadumba. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na waja wayonile mbuli ayo, wawalongela wanhu vija munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela viyahonyigwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu wose wa isi ija ya Wagelasi wampula Yesu yalawanye, kwavija wakala wadumbile ng'hani. Avo Yesu kakwela mwiingalawa na kulawanya. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kampula Yesu wachole wose.</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini Yesu hamtogolele, kamulongela, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Bwela ukayako ukawalongele wanhu gose gayakutendele Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Avo munhu ija kachola kila hanhu kudibuga dija, kawapetela wanhu mbuli zose ziyatendeligwe na Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa Yailo na mtwanzi yakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 9:18-26; Mlk 5:21-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu viyabwelile mwambu uyagwe wa lamba, wanhu wambokela kwa deng'ho kwavija wose wakala wombeta. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Abaho keza munhu imoja, twaga jake Yailo. Munhu ayo kakala mkulu wa ng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu. Kamfugamila Yesu, kampula yachole ukayake, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kwavija mndele wake yeli yaiyeka kakala mmabehi kufa. Mndele ayo kakala na miyaka longo na mibili.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu viyakalile kochola, wanhu wakala womsung'ha sung'ha kila mwambu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mna dibumbila dija da wanhu, kukala na mtwanzi imoja yakalile na utamu wa kutumika kwa miyaka longo na mibili. Kakala yamambukize vinhu vake vose kwa waganga, lakini kuduhu munhu yadahile kumuhonya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ija kamcholela Yesu kukisogo, kakwasa mhindo ya kiwalo cha Yesu, bahaja kutumika kuleka. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kauza, “Nani yanikwasile?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wanhu wose wabela. Petulo kalonga, “Go mkulu, wanhu wose wakuzunguluka na kukusung'ha sung'ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kalonga, “Kuna munhu kanikwasa, kwavija nihulika nguvu zinilawa.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ija viyone hadaha kuifisa, keza yogwaya, kaibwanha mmagulu ga Yesu. Baho mgameso ga wanhu, kamulongela Yesu habali kakwasa mhindo ya kiwalo chake, na vija viyahonyigwe bahaja. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mwanangu, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya. Chola moyo uholile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, msenga kulawa ukayake Yailo keza, kamulongela Yailo, “Mndele wako kamala kufa, avo sekeumgaze Mfundiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu viyahulike avo, kamulongela Yailo, “Sekeudumbe, gweye togola tu, mndele wako kohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Viyavikile kuna ing'anda ya Yailo, Yesu kawagomesa wanhu sekewengile hamoja nayo, ila kengila na Petulo na Yohana, na Yakobo na tatake na mamake mndele ayo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakala wolila na kumuyalalila imwana. Yesu kawalongela, “Sekemulile, kwavija imwana hafile bule, kawasa tu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wamseka kwavija wakala wajuwile imwana kakala yafile. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamgoga mkono, kamulongela, “Mwanangu, lamuka!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ugima wake umbwelela mndele ija, bahaja kalamuka. Abaho Yesu kawalagiza wamgwee lujo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Tatake na mamake wakanganya ng'hani, lakini Yesu kawagomesa sekewamulongele munhu yoyose kija kilawilile.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma wanahina zake longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:5-15; Mlk 6:7-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawakema hamoja wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawagwaa nguvu na udahi wa kulava vinyamkela na kuwahonya watamu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abaho kawatuma wachole wakawapetele wanhu usenga wa Undewa wa Mulungu na kuhonya watamu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Sekemusole kinhu chochose muumwanza wenu. Sekemusole mkongoja, wala mkoba, wala lujo, wala sente, wala viwalo vibili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ng'anda yoyose yonda mwingile na kugonekigwa, kaleni mumo mbaka vonda musegele mna idibuga dijo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wanhu wahalema kuwabokela, segeleni buga dijo na kung'huseni timbwisi dili mmagulu genu kiwe kilaguso kamba wawatendela nzambi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wanahina wafunga mwanza, wabitila vijiji vose wowapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile na kuwahonya wanhu kila hanhu.</para>
  <para style="s">Helode konyawanyawa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:1-12; Mlk 6:14-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Helode yakalile mndewa wa Galilaya, kahulika mbuli zose ziyatendile Yesu. Kanyawanyawa ng'hani, kwavija wanhu wakala wolonga Yohana Mbatizaji kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonga Eliya kalawilila, wayagwe walonga imoja wa watula ndagu wa Mulungu wa umwaka kazilibuka kulawa kuna iwanhu wafile. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini Helode kalonga, “Yohana nimkanha dipala, vino ino ayo nani inihulika mbuli zake?” Nayo kalonda kumona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa lujo wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 14:13-21; Mlk 6:30-44; Yoh 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Watumigwa waja viwabwelile, wamulongela Yesu kila kinhu wakitendile. Yesu kawasola, kachola nao waiyeka kuna dibuga dikemigwe Betisaida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu viwajuwile avo, wamkweleleza Yesu. Nayo kawabokela, kalonga nao mbuli ya Undewa wa Mulungu na kawahonya waja wakalile watamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zuwa vidisongile kuhonga, wanahina longo na wabili wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Walongele wanhu wachole kuna ivijiji na migunda ilibehi na hano wakazahile lujo na hanhu ha kuwasa, kwavija hano hatwili twa kuluwala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wagweleleni lujo waje.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini wao wamwidika, “Tuna magate matano na somba wabili tu. Kolonda tuchole tukawagulile lujo lunhu lose luno?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wakalile hanhu aho wakala wovika elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale mna ivibumbila va wanhu malongo matano.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nao wanahina watenda vivo. Wanhu wose wakala hasi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kagasola magate matano na somba wabili, kalola uchanha kuulanga, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kagabanzula gamagate na iwasomba, kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagwelele wanhu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wanhu wose waja na kwiguta. Wanahina zake wasola vigelo longo na vibili vimemile vinhu visigale.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo komtogola Yesu ayo Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:13-19; Mlk 8:27-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala yaiyeka kompula Mulungu. Wanahina zake wamcholela, nayo kawauza, “Vino wanhu wolonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Wanhu wayagwe wolonga gweye kwa Yohana Mbatizaji, wayagwe wolonga kwa Eliya, kuno wayagwe wolonga gweye kwa imoja wa watula ndagu wa Mulungu wa umwaka yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye molonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye kwa Kilisito, wa Mulungu.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanahina zake sekewamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:20-28; Mlk 8:30-9:1</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vivija Yesu kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yadununzike ng'hani, na kulemigwa na wavele na wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Kokomigwa lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanhu wose, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kunikweleleza, yaileme mwenyego, yaidikwe msalaba wake kila siku, yanikweleleze. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yolonda kuukombola ugima wake mwenyego kowagiza, lakini munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake mbuli ya niye, koukombola. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vino munhu yahapata kila kinhu mwiisi, lakini kowagiza ugima wake, munhu ayo kopata choni? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamba munhu konyonela kinyala niye na mafundizo gangu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo yaheza muukulu wake na wa Tatake na wasenga wa kuulanga wang'alile komonela kinyala munhu ayo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini nowalongela ukweli, wanhu wayagwe wemile hano honda wafe mbaka wawone Undewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaluka ikihanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:1-8; Mlk 9:2-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vizibitile siku nane toka yalonge mbuli azo, Yesu kawasola Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo kachola nao kukigongo kumpula Mulungu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Viyakalile kompula Mulungu, kihanga chake kigaluka, viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahaja wanhu wabili wakala aho wolonga nayo. Nao wakala Musa na Eliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>wakoneka muukulu, wakala wolonga na Yesu mbuli ya ifa yake yonda yaimambukize ako Yelusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Petulo na wayage wakala wokuluza. Viwalamuke, wawona ukulu wa Yesu na wanhu wabili wemile nayo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanhu waja viwakalile wosegela, Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Go mkulu, vinoga tweye tukale hano! Tuzenge viheha vidatu, kimoja chako, kimoja cha Musa na kimoja cha Eliya.” Petulo kakala hajuwa bule kija kiyolonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petulo yang'hali yolonga, wingu dilawilila, diwagubika na kungugu jake, wanahina wadumba ng'hani wingu dijo vidiwagubike. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sauti ilonga kulawa mdiwingu, “Ino ayo Mwanangu inimsagule. Mtegelezeni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Sauti ayo viinyamale, Yesu kasigala yaiyeka. Wanahina wanyamala tuluu, na kipindi kija hawamulongele munhu yoyose kija kiwone.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulava mbwanga imoja kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:14-18; Mlk 9:14-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Imitondo yake Yesu na wanahina zake wadatu wahumuluka kukigongo. Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu luiting'hana na Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Munhu imoja mna ulunhu kaguta, “Mfundiza! Nokupula undolele mwanangu, mwanangu yeli yaiyeka! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kinyamkela komkumba na komtenda yagute nyangi, komgela kisango kuno kolawa miholovu mumulomo. Kogendelela kumulumiza na hamuleka hima bule! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Niwapula wanahina zako wamulave kinyamkela ayo, lakini hawadahile bule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye lukolo luliduhu kutamanila na lwagile! Nokala na mweye mbaka lini? Nogela kitumbe kumgongo mbaka lini?” Abaho kamulongela munhu ija, “Mgale hano mwanago.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mbwanga ija viyakalile komwizila Yesu, kinyamkela kambwanha hasi na kamgela kisango. Lakini Yesu kamkomhokela kinyamkela, kamuhonya mbwanga ija, na kamgwaa tatake. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya kwa udahi mkulu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kabili mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 17:22-23; Mlk 9:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">Wanhu viwakalile wang'hali wokanganya mbuli ziyatendile Yesu, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Sekemuisemwe mbuli inilonda kuwalongela! Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawajuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo. Ukala ufisigwe kumwao avo hawadahile kuujuwa, nao wadumba kumuuza Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nani yeli munhu mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 18:1-5; Mlk 9:33-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wanahina wa Yesu wasonga kuibamilila wao kwa wao nani yeli munhu mkulu viweli. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile wogesa, kamsola mwana mdodo, kamwika behi nayo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yombokela mwana ino kwa twaga jangu, konibokela niye, na munhu yoyose yombokela niye, kombokela ija yanhumile. Kwavija munhu yeli mdodo vimwili, ayo munhu mkulu kubanza wose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu hamwihilani mweye miyenu</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 9:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohana kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, tumona munhu kolava vinyamkela kwa twaga jako. Tumgomesa kwavija halawa mkibumbila chetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela Yohana na wanahina wayagwe, “Sekemumgomese, kwavija munhu yoyose hamwihilani mweye miyenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa kijiji cha Samalia wolema kumbokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kipindi cha Yesu kugaligwa kuulanga vikikalile mmabehi, kagangamala, kachola Yelusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawatuma wasenga wamulongolele wachole kuna ikijiji kili mwiisi ya Samalia kumtandila kila kinhu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu wa kijiji cha Samalia hawambokele Yesu, kwavija wajuwa kamba kakala kochola Yelusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Wanahina zake, Yakobo na Yohana viwone avo, walonga, “Mndewa, kolonda tulagize moto kulawa kuulanga uwasakaze wose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu kahinduka kawakomhokela. Kawalongela, “Hamujuwile bule loho gani imulinayo, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu hezile kuubananga ugima wa wanhu lakini keza kuukombola.” <verse number="56" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kuna ikijiji kiyagwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wofaya kumkweleleza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 8:19-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Viwakalile mnzila, munhu imoja kamulongela Yesu, “Nokukweleleza kokose konda uchole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Vizongo wana mhango na ndege wana mvulu, lakini Mwana wa Munhu kaduhu hanhu ha kubwihila na kutambalala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu iyagwe, “Nikweleleze.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini munhu ija kalonga, “Go mkulu, beta tanhu mbwele ukae hamzike tatangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Waleke wanhu wafile wawazike wanhu wafile wayao. Lakini gweye chola ukawapetele wanhu Undewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Munhu iyagwe kalonga, “Go mkulu, nokukweleleza, lakini beta tanhu halulage lukolo lwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu yoyose yokwaluka kulima abaho kolola kukisogo, hafaya Muundewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma wanhu malongo saba na wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abaho Mndewa Yesu kawasagula wanhu wayagwe malongo saba na wabili, kawatuma wabili wabili wamulongolele kila kijiji na kila hanhu kuyalondile kuchola. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Kuna ndiya nyingi lakini wasang'hanaji wadodo. Mpuleni Mndewa wa indiya yawatume wasang'hanaji mumgunda wake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gendeni! Nowatuma mweye kamba ng'hondolo mna iwambwizi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sekemusole mfuko hebu mkoba hebu vilatu. Sekemwime na kumulamusa munhu yoyose mnzila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ng'anda yoyose yonda mwingile, tanhu mulonge, ‘Tindiwalo dikale mng'anda ino.’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kamba hana munhu kodinogela tindiwalo, tindiwalo jenu dokala nayo, kamba kuduhu munhu yodinogela tindiwalo, tindiwalo jenu dowabwelela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mkale mng'anda ayo, diyeni na kung'wa chochose chonda wawagwelele, kwavija msang'hanaji kolondeka yapate malipo gake. Sekemuhamehame kulawa ng'anda imoja kuchola iyagwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Buga jojose donda mwingile na kubokeligwa, diyeni vija vonda wawagwelele. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wahonyeni watamu weli kuko, na muwalongele, ‘Undewa wa Mulungu wa behi yenu.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini buga jojose donda mwingile na wanhu wolema kuwabokela, laweni mumo, na vimubita kuna zinzila zao, mulonge, <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Hata matimbwisi ga buga jenu gatunanahile mmagulu getu togakung'husa kiwe kilaguso kumwenu kamba mututendela gehile. Lakini mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmabehi!’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mna isiku ya nhaguso, Mulungu kolagusa bazi ng'hani kwa wanhu wa buga da Sodoma kubanza wanhu wa buga dijo!</para>
  <para style="s">Mabuga golema kutogola</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 11:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kogaya gweye buga da Kolazini! Kogaya gweye buga da Betisaida! Maza unzonza utendigwe kumwenu mweye wahatendigwe mna gamabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu zake wahalekile mwaka nzambi zao na kuvala magunia na kuibakaza mitozi, kulagusa kamba waleka nzambi! <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwiisiku ya nhaguso, Mulungu kolagusa bazi ng'hani kwa wanhu wa mabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni kubanza mweye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gweye buga da Kapelinaumu, vino kolonda kuinula mwenyego mbaka uchanha kuulanga? Mawe! Kohumulusigwa mbaka kowochola wanhu wafile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yowategeleza mweye, konhegeleza niye, na yoyose yowalema mweye, kondema niye. Na munhu yoyose yondema niye, komulema ija yanhumile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa waja malongo saba na wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu waja malongo saba na wabili wabwela kuno wodeng'helela. Walonga, “Mndewa, hata vinyamkela watutegeleza vituwakomhokele kwa twaga jako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nimona Mwenembago kolagala kulawa kuulanga kamba lumwesa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tegelezeni! Niwagwaa udahi, avo modaha kukanyaga mgendela hasi na inge na kuzihuma nguvu zose za Mwenembago. Kuduhu kinhu chonda kiwalumize. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini sekemudeng'helele kwavija vinyamkela wowategeleza, ila deng'heleleni kwavija matwaga genu gandikigwa kuulanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodeng'helela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 11:25-27; 13:16-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kipindi kija Yesu kadeng'helela kwa udahi wa Loho Yang'alile, kalonga, “Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na mwiisi! Nokutogola kwavija kuwafisa mbuli zino wanhu weli na nzewele na ubala, na kuwagubulila wana wadodo. Ona, Tata, vino vivo viulondile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Tatangu kanigwaa vinhu vose. Kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Mwana ila Tata yaiyeka, na kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Tata ila Mwana na waja wose Mwana yawasagule kuwagubulila wamjuwe Tata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawahindukila wanahina zake, kalonga nao kinyelegezi, “Wamweda wanhu wose wovona vinhu vimona mweye! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nowalongela ukweli, watula ndagu wengi wa Mulungu na wandewa walonda kuvona vimona mweye, lakini hawavonile bule, na vivija walonda kuhulika vimuhulika mweye, lakini hawahulike bule.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa Msamalia yanogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Munhu imoja yagajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa, kachola kwa Yesu yamgeze. Avo kamuuza, “Mfundiza, vino nhende choni niupate ugima wa mazuwa gose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vino, Malagizo golongaze na gweye kogajuwaze?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Munhu ija kamwidika, “ ‘Mnogele Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, na kwa loho yako yose, na kwa nguvu zako zose, na kwa nzewele zako zose,’ na ‘Umnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kulonga goya, tenda vivo na gweye kokuwa na ugima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini munhu ija kalonda kuilagusa kamba kanoga, avo kamuuza Yesu, “Vino miyangu ayo nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu imoja kakala kolawa Yelusalemu kochola Yeliko. Mnzila, wabavi wamgoga, wamboka vinhu vake, na kumtowa, wamuleka habehi na kufa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abaho mulava nhosa imoja kakala yohumuluka kubitila nzila iija. Viyamone, kainega, kabitila kumgwazo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vivija Mlawi imoja viyavikile aho, kamulola munhu ija, nayo kainega, kabitila kumgwazo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini Msamalia imoja yakalile muumwanza kavika aho hayakalile munhu ija. Nayo viyamone, kamonela bazi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kamcholela, kamgela mavuta na divai mna ivilonda vake na kavifunga goya. Abaho kamwika uchanha mwa mhunda wake, kamgala mbaka kuna ing'anda ya wageni na kumulolesa goya. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imitondo yake kalava sente kamgwaa mwene ng'anda, kamulongela, ‘Mulolese goya munhu ino. Chochose chonda umsang'hanile, nahabwela nokugwaa fungu jako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamuuza, “Viukona gweye, mna iwanhu awo wadatu, nani yakalile miyage munhu ija yatoigwe na wabavi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Munhu ija kamwidika, “Ija yamonele bazi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamulongela, “Na gweye genda ukatende vivo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatembelela Mata na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwakalile mnzila, wengila kuna ikijiji kimoja. Mtwanzi imoja twaga jake Mata kambokela ukayake. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mata kakala na mdodo wake yakemigwe Malia, yakalile hasi behi na magulu ga Yesu na kutegeleza mafundizo gake. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini Mata kakala yohunganika na sang'hano nyingi ziyalondeke kusang'hana, avo kamcholela Yesu, kamulongela, “Mndewa, vino hutonga bule kamba mdodo wangu kanilekela sang'hano zose nisang'hane niiyeka? Mulongele yeze yanitaze!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lakini Mndewa kamwidika, “Gwee Mata gwee! Kohunganika na kugaya kwa vinhu vingi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>lakini kimoja kiiyeka kilondeka. Malia kasagula kinhu kinogile, na honda kisegezigwe bule kumwake.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza kumpula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 6:9-13; 7:7-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala hanhu kompula Mulungu. Viyamambukize, mwanahina wake imoja kamulongela, “Mndewa, tufundize kupula, kamba vija Yohana viyawafundize wanahina zake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwahampula Mulungu, longeni vino.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tataetu uli kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q">Twaga jako ditogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Undewa wako wize.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Utugwee lelo lujo lwa kila siku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Uzigele kumgongo nzambi zetu,</para>
  <para style="q">kamba vija tweye vituzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q">Sekeutwingize kuna ukugezigwa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu gani kumwenu yeli na mbwiga yahamcholela kilo kikulu na kumulongela, ‘Mbwigangu, ng'hopeshe magate madatu, <verse number="6" style="v"/>kwavija mbwigangu keza, kalawa mwanza, na niye nabule lujo lwa kumgwaa!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>na ija yeli mng'anda yamwidike, ‘Sekeunigaze! Lwivi luhindigwa mwaka, na niye na wanangu tuwasa, avo sidaha kulamuka kukugwaa kinhu chochose.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nowalongela vino, hata yahalema kulamuka na kumgwaa magate kwavija mbwigake, lakini kwavija kaduhu kinyala kugendelela kumpula, kolamuka na kumgwaa kila kinhu kiyopula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Avo nowalongela, puleni na mweye mogweleligwa, zahileni na mweye movona, gong'ondeni ulwivi na mweye movugulilwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwavija waja wose wompula Mulungu wogweleligwa, na waja wozahila wopata, na lwivi lovuguligwa kwa munhu yoyose yogong'onda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vino kuna munhu yoyose kumwenu kamba mwanage yahampula somba, heyo komgwaa zoka? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hebu yahampula finga komgwaa inge? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kamba mweye wene nzambi mojuwa kuwagwaa wanenu vinhu vinogile, lakini Tataenu yeli kuulanga kowagwaa ng'hani Loho Yang'alile wanhu waja wompula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:22-30; Mlk 3:20-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala komulava kinyamkela yamtendile munhu imoja yalemelwe kulonga. Kinyamkela ayo viyamulawile, munhu ija kasonga kulonga. Lunhu lwa wanhu lukanganya ng'hani, <verse number="15" style="v"/>lakini wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela, ayo yomgwaa udahi wa kulava vinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonda kumgeza Yesu, avo wampula yatende kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile wokigesa, avo kawalongela, “Undewa wowose wahaigola mna ivibumbila na kuitowa, undewa awo wofa, na lubuga lumoja lwahaigola, lubuga lulo lofa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Avo kamba undewa wa Mwenembago wahaigola mvibumbila na kuitowa, undewa awo wokwimaze? Mweye molonga niye nolava vinyamkela kwavija Belizebuli konigwaa udahi wa kutenda vivo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kamba nolava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, avo wanhu wenu wolava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa nani? Kwa mbuli ayo wanhu wenu wenyego wowatagusa kamba mobananga! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini kamba nowalava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Mulungu, avo mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Mulungu uvika mwaka kumwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Munhu mwene nguvu viyokaliza ng'anda yake kwa silaha, vinhu vake havisoligwa bule. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini yaheza munhu mwene nguvu kubanza heyo, komtowa na kumuhuma, komboka silaha zake ziyatamanile na koigolela na wayage vija viyasolile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Munhu yoyose heli ubanzi wangu konilema, na munhu yoyose yolema kunitaza kwika hamoja, ayo kopwililisa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kinyamkela yahamulawa munhu, kochola mwiisi inyalile kuzahila hanhu ha kubwihila. Yahaswela, koilongela, ‘Nobwela ukayangu kunilawile.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yahabwela na kuivika ng'anda ifagiligwa na kila kinhu kikigwa goya, <verse number="26" style="v"/>baho kobwela na kuwagala vinyamkela wayagwe saba wehile kubanza heyo, awo wokwiza na kukala mumo. Avo ugima wa munhu ayo wokuwa wiha kubanza aho haichanduso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Deng'ho da kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu yang'hali yolonga, mtwanzi imoja kulawa kuna ulunhu kamulongela kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Kamweda mtwanzi yakulelile na kukukong'heza!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Wamweda ng'hani wanhu wose wohulika mbuli ya Mulungu na kuigoga!”</para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wolonda unzonza</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 12:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wanhu viwakalile womsung'ha sung'ha, Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Lukolo luno lwa wanhu wotenda nzambi! Lolonda kilaguso, lakini kuduhu kilaguso chochose chonda wagweleligwe, ila kilaguso cha Yona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kamba vija mtula ndagu wa Mulungu Yona viyakalile kilaguso kwa wanhu wa Ninawi, vivo ili kwa Mwana wa Munhu vonda yawe kilaguso kwa wanhu wa lukolo luno. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso, Malikia wa Sheba kokwima na kuwatagusa mweye kamba mubananga, kwavija heyo kafunga mwanza kulawa mwiisi yake kachola kumtegeleza Mndewa Sulemani na mafundizo gake geli na nzewele. Nowalongela, hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Sulemani. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso, wanhu wa Ninawi wokwima na kuwatagusa mweye, kwavija awo waleka nzambi Yona viyawapetele. Lakini nowalongela, hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Yona!</para>
  <para style="s">Mulenge wa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 5:15; Mat 6:22-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kuduhu munhu yobwinha taa na kuigubika na kikalango, lakini koika kukingolobweda, muladi wanhu wokwingila mng'anda wone mulenge. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Meso gako mulukuli lwako gaigala na taa. Kamba meso gako magima, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa na mulenge, lakini meso gako gahabanangika, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa mdiziza. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Muiteganye, mulenge uli mgati mmwenu sekeuwe ziza. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamba lukuli lwako lose lwahawa na mulenge, na kuduhu hanhu heli na ziza, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa na lenge eka, kamba vija taa viimwemwesa mulenge wake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalonga Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 23:1-36; Mlk 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga, Mfalisayo imoja kamgoneka ukayake wakaje hamoja, avo Yesu kengila mng'anda, kakala hasi, kasonga kuja. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mfalisayo ayo kakanganya ng'hani viyamone Yesu koja bila kusunha makono gake. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Avo Mndewa kamulongela, “Mweye Mafalisayo mosunha vikasi na sahani kwa kunze, lakini mgati mmwenu mmema ubokaji na gehile. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mweye mwa wabozi! Vino siyo Mulungu yavitendile va kunze na va mgati vivija? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lakini laveni vili mgati na muwagwee wakiwa na kila kinhu chonoga kumwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mogaya mweye Mafalisayo! Kwavija momgwaa Mulungu fungu da longo da majani gonung'hila goya kamba vija binzali na kalafuu, na mboga ziyagwe, lakini moleka kutenda ganogile kwa wanhu na kumnogela Mulungu. Molondeka kutenda gano na sekemugaleke gago gayagwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mogaya mweye Mafalisayo! Kwavija monogelwa kukala kuna ivigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na kulamusigwa mna gamagulilo. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mogaya mweye! Kwavija muigala na mapanga hagakoneka, wanhu wobita uchanha bila kugajuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Munhu imoja yagajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, wahalonga avo, kotuliga tweye vivija!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vivija mogaya mweye mugajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa! Kwavija mowapapiza wanhu mizigo mikulu, lakini mweye wenyego hamulonda kugolosa makono kuwataza kupapa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mogaya mweye, kwavija mogazengela goya mapanga ga watula ndagu wa Mulungu, waja wakomigwe na wahenga zenu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mweye wenyego mokitogola kija kiwatendile wahenga zenu, kwavija wao wawakoma watula ndagu wa Mulungu, na mweye mogazengela goya mapanga gao. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kwa mbuli ayo, nzewele ya Mulungu ilonga, ‘Nowatuma watula ndagu wa Mulungu na watumigwa, wayagwe wowakoma na wayagwe wowadununza!’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Avo wanhu wa lukolo luno wotagusigwa mbuli ya kuwakoma watula ndagu wose wa Mulungu, kulawa kuna ichanduso cha isi, <verse number="51" style="v"/>toka kukomigwa kwa Habili mbaka kukomigwa kwa Zakalia, ija yakomigwe hagati ha upango wa kulavila nhosa na Hanhu Hong'ala. Ona, nowalongela, wanhu wa lukolo luno wotagusigwa kwa kuwakoma wao!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa! Kwavija mofisa luvugulo lwa kuvugulila lwivi lwa ng'anda ya kuifunzila. Mweye wenyego hamwingila bule, abaho muwagomesa waja wakalile wolonda kwingila sekewengile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu viyasegele hanhu aho, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kumulonga vihile na kumuuza mbuli nyingi, <verse number="54" style="v"/>wageza kumnamata kwa mbuli zake zonda yalonge.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wanhu mbuli ya unafiki</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:26-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wanhu wengi waiting'hana hamoja mbaka wanhu wakala woikanyaga. Tanhu Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Iteganyeni na usasu wa Mafalisayo, nao ndo unafiki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chogubuligwa, na kija kifisigwe chojuwika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Avo chochose kimulongile mdiziza chohulikigwa mmulenge, na chochose kimunyong'onye mwiiyeka mdigati dihindigwe chopetigwa mkiswili.</para>
  <para style="s">Ija wa kumdumba</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nowalongela mweye mbwiga zangu, sekemuwadumbe wanhu waja woukoma lukuli, abaho hawadaha kutenda kinhu kiyagwe chochose kihile. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini nowalagusila wa kumdumba, mdumbeni Mulungu, heyo yahakoma, kana udahi wa kumwasa munhu muumoto wa jehanamu. Nowalongeleni, mdumbeni ayo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Vino nhongwa watano hawachuuzigwa kwa sente ndodo mbili? Lakini kuduhu hata imoja yosemwigwa na Mulungu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hata mvili zili mmapala genu zipetigwa zose. Avo sekemudumbe. Mweye munoga ng'hani kubanza nhongwa wengi!</para>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola na kumulema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:32-33; 12:32; 10:19-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Nowalongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yonitogola niye mgameso ga wanhu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo komtogola mgameso ga wasenga wa Mulungu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yonibela niye mgameso ga wanhu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo kombela mgameso ga wasenga wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Munhu yoyose yomulonga vihile Mwana wa Munhu, nzambi zake zogeligwa kumgongo, lakini munhu yoyose yomuliga Loho Yang'alile, nzambi zake honda zigeligwe kumgongo bule.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Wahawagala haulongozi wa ng'anda za kumpula Mulungu, na mgameso ga wakulu wa isi na wandewa, sekemunyawenyawe vija vonda mwidike hebu kija chonda mulonge. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwavija Loho Yang'alile kowafundiza saa iija kimulondeka kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa tajili mbozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Munhu imoja muulunhu kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, mulongele ndugu yangu tuigolele uhazi wa tataetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mbwigangu, nani yanigwelele udahi wa kuwalamula hebu kuwagolela uhazi wenu?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Abaho kagendelela kuwalongela wose, “Muiteganye na ugila! Kwavija ugima wa munhu hautamanila wingi wa vinhu viyalinavo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na mgunda uli na ndiya nyingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kasonga kugelegeza mwenyego, ‘Nabule hanhu hakwika ndiya yangu yose. Nhendeze?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Abaho kailongela, ‘Notenda vino, nogatula makanho gangu na kuzenga makulu ng'hani. Mumo nokwika ndiya yangu na vinhu vangu viyagwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abaho noilongela, gweye moyo wangu! Kuna vinhu vose vinogile kwa miyaka heleketwaa. Bwihila, diya, ing'wa, na kudeng'helela!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini Mulungu kamulongela, ‘Gweye kwa mbozi! Kilo cha lelo noulonda ugima wako, abaho vinhu vose vino viuikile vokuwa va nani?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Vino vivo ili kwa waja woikila vinhu vao wenyego, lakini haweka vinhu vao kwa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumtamanila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 6:25-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nowalongela, sekemulugaiye lujo lumulonda muladi muwe wagima, hebu viwalo vimulonda kwa ng'huli zenu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwavija ugima unoga kubanza lujo, na lukuli lunoga kubanza viwalo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Waloleni bondwa, hawahanda, hawasenga, waduhu makanho, lakini Mulungu kowadima! Vino Mulungu hawanogela ng'hani mweye kubanza iwabondwa? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nani kumwenu kwa kuigaza ng'hani kodaha kwengeza hata saa dimoja da ugima wake? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kumbe hamudaha kutenda mbuli ndodo kamba ino, habali moigaza kwa mbuli ziyagwe? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Loleni maluwa vigokula. Hagasang'hana hebu hagaisonela viwalo. Lakini nowalongela kweli, hata mndewa Sulemani, hamoja na utajili wake wose kakala kaduhu viwalo vinogile viigalile na maluwa gano. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kamba Mulungu heyo yodivaza jani da kumuhulo, lelo dabahano na mayo dokwasigwa muumoto, vino hondayawavaze ng'hani mweye? Mweye wanhu mutamanila kidogo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Avo sekemuigaze moja choni, hebu mong'wa choni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwavija vinhu avo, vivo voogaiya wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Tataenu yeli kuulanga kojuwa molonda vinhu vose avo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini uzahileni tanhu Undewa wa Mulungu, nayo kowagwaa vinhu avo.</para>
  <para style="s">Utajili wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 6:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Sekemudumbe mweye kibumbila kidodo cha wanahina zangu, kwavija Tataenu kanogelwa kuwagwaa mweye Undewa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Chuuzeni vose vimulinavo na muwagwelele wakiwa zisente. Muitendele mikoba hailala, na muikile ngama yenu kuulanga. Ako hondaihunguke, kwavija kuduhu wabavi wodaha kuhavika na kuduhu ng'hobo wodaha kuibananga. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kwavija kuko kuili ngama yako, vivija kuko kondauwe moyo wako.</para>
  <para style="s">Wasang'hanaji welimeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Muitande na kuifunga mikwiji mvigudi, na taa zenu ziwe zokwaka, <verse number="36" style="v"/>kamba wasang'hanaji viwombetela mkulu wao yabwele kulawa kuna idizengele. Yahabwela na kugong'onda ulwivi, himahima womvugulila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wamweda wasang'hanaji waja mkulu wao yahabwela kowavika meso! Nowalongeleni ukweli, mkulu ayo kosaula koti jake, kowalongela wakale hasi muulujo nayo kowasang'hanila. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Wamweda wasang'hanaji waja mkulu wao kowavika wang'hali meso, hata kamba yahabwela kilo kikulu hebu nzogolo zikwika! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lakini mujuwe vino, kamba mwene ng'anda yahajuwile saa ya kwiza mbavi, yahakalile meso, na sambi yaileke ng'anda yake ituligwe na mbavi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Na mweye vivija molondeka mwiitande, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza mna isaa hamuigesile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hanaji yatamaniligwa na hatamaniligwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:45-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, vino lusimo luno kutulongela tweye twiiyeka, hebu kuwalongela wanhu wose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mndewa kamwidika, “Vino msang'hanaji gani yotamaniligwa na yeli na nzewele? Ayo ija mkulu wake komwika yalolese wasang'hanaji wayagwe, na yawagwee lujo mna isaa inogile. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kamweda msang'hanaji ija mkulu wake yahabwela komvika kosang'hana vivo! <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mkulu wake komwika msang'hanaji ayo yawe mulolesaji wa vinhu vake vose. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini msang'hanaji ija yahailongela mwenyego, ‘Mkulu wangu kokawa ng'hani kubwela.’ Baho kosonga kuwatowa wasang'hanaji wayagwe, wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo, kuno koja na kung'wa mbaka kokoligwa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Abaho mkulu wake kobwela mna isiku msang'hanaji ija haigesile na mna isaa haijuwile bule. Mkulu ayo komtowa ng'hani na kumwika hamoja na wanhu hawatogola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Msang'hanaji ija yajuwile kija kiyolonda mkulu wake yakisang'hane, lakini hakisang'hana bule msang'hanaji ayo kotowigwa ng'hani. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lakini msang'hanaji ija hakijuwile kiyolonda mkulu wake, abaho kotenda kinhu kihile, msang'hanaji ayo kotowigwa kidogo. Munhu yagweleligwe vingi kodaigwa vingi, na munhu yagweleligwe vingi ng'hani kodaigwa vingi ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatenda wanhu waigole</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Niza kubwinha moto mwiisi, vinondile niye wahakile mwaka! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nina ubatizo nolondigwa niubokele, na niye nougaiya ng'hani mbaka umale! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Vino mweye mogesa niza kugala tindiwalo mwiisi? Bule! Sizile kugala tindiwalo, lakini kuwagola wanhu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kulawa sambi, wanhu watano wa ng'anda imoja woigola, wadatu kwa wabili, na wabili kwa wadatu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Tata koigola na mwanage, na mwana koigola na tatake. Mama koigola na mndele wake, na mndele koigola na mamake. Mama mkwe koigola na mkwe wake wa kitwanzi, na mkwe wa kitwanzi koigola na mama mkwe wake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kujuwa vipindi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 16:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu kabili, “Mwahajona wingu dolawilila mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, baho molonga, ‘Mvula kotowa,’ na kweli kotowa. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na mwahajona beho da kusini nyukwanyukwa molonga, ‘Hokuwa na joto,’ na yokuwa vivo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mweye mwa wanafiki! Modaha kulola isi na ulanga na kulagula kamba mvula kotowa hebu hatowa, habali hamujuwile fambulo da kipindi kino?</para>
  <para style="s">Ilumbe na munhu yakwihile</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 5:25-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Habali hamudaha kujuwa wenyego mbuli zinogile za kusang'hana? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Kamba munhu kokugala mkitala, vinoga uilumbe nayo mung'hali mnzila. Wahalemelwa, kokugala kwa msemi, nayo msemi kokugala mmakono ga wakalizi, nao wokugodeka mkifungo. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nokulongela, mumo humulawa ng'o, mbaka ulipe sente yose!”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lekeni nzambi buleavo mofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kipindi kikija wanhu wayagwe wakala aho, wamulongela Yesu mbuli ya Wagalilaya wakomigwe na Pilato kipindi viwakalile womulavila nhosa Mulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mogesa Wagalilaya awo wakala na nzambi nyingi kubanza Wagalilaya wayagwe lekaavo wadununzika vivo? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bule! Nowalongela kweli, na mweye vivija mwahalema kuleka nzambi zenu, mose mofa kamba awo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hebu mogesa wanhu waja longo na wanane wafile kwa kulagaliligwa na lingo ako Siloamu wakala na nzambi nyingi kubanza wanhu wose kudibuga da Yelusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bule! Nowalongela, mwahalema kuleka nzambi, mose mofa kamba awo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbiki wa matunda haulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Munhu imoja kahanda mbiki wa matunda mumgunda wake wa mizabibu. Kachola kuzahila matunda, lakini hapatile tunda jojose bule. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Avo kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lola, mwaka uno wa kadatu nokwiza hano kuzahila matunda mumbiki uno, lakini sipata chochose. Ukanhe! Habali ugendelele kuibananga isi?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini msang'hanaji wake kamwidika, ‘Go mkulu, uleke mwaka uno uiyeka, nouhalilila na kuwikila mbolea. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho kamba wahalela yokuwa goya, lakini wahaleka kulela, kodaha kuukanha!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mtwanzi siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Siku dimoja da Kubwihila, Yesu kakala yofundiza mng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Baho kukala na mtwanzi imoja. Mtwanzi ayo kakala na kinyamkela yamtendile yalumwe miyaka longo na nane. Kakala yaveduke mgongo na hadahile kuigolosa bule. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu viyamone, kamkema, kamulongela, “Mama, kuhonyigwa utamu wako!” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kamwikila makono, bahaja lukuli lwake lugoloka, nayo kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini mkulu wa ng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu kagevuzika kwavija Yesu kamuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila. Avo kawalongela wanhu, “Mnazo siku sita za kusang'hana. Mzisiku azo, mwize muhonyigwe, lakini sekemwize kudisiku da Kubwihila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mndewa kamwidika, “Mweye mwa wanafiki! Vino, nani kumwenu yoleka kumfungula ng'ombe wake hebu mhunda wake kulawa mdizizi na kumulongoza yachole kung'wa mazi mwiisiku ya Kubwihila? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mtwanzi ino kolawa mulukolo lwa Abulahamu. Nayo kakala yagogigwe na Mwenembago kwa miyaka longo na nane. Vino halondeke kulekesigwa mwiisiku ya Kubwihila?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mbuli azo ziyalongile Yesu ziwatenda waja wamwihile wagwe kinyala, lakini wanhu wayagwe wakala wodeng'helela kwa mbuli zose za unzonza ziyasang'hane Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:31-32; Mlk 4:30-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza, “Vino Undewa wa Mulungu uigala na choni? Vino niusimulile kwa lusimo gani? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yasolile mbeyu ndodo ya haladali na kuihanda mumgunda wake. Mbeyu ayo yota na kuwa mbiki mkulu, na ndege wazenga mvulu zao mna gamatambi gake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 13:33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza kabili, “Vino Undewa wa Mulungu uigala na choni? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa mtwanzi yasolile mela na kuditibwiliza hamoja na madebe mabili ga usage, abaho usage wose ugongomoka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mulango msisili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 7:13-14, 21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela na mwanza wake kuchola Yelusalemu, kubitila kuna gamabuga na vijiji kowapetela wanhu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Munhu imoja kamuuza, “Go mkulu, vino wonda wakomboligwe wanhu wadodo waiyeka?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Gangamaleni mwingile kubitila ulwivi msisili, kwavija wanhu wengi wolonda kwingila lakini honda wadahe bule. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwene ng'anda kokwinuka na kuhinda ulwivi. Mweye mokwima kunze na kusonga kugong'onda ulwivi molonga, ‘Mndewa, tuvugulile!’ Nayo kowedika, ‘Sikujuwile kumulawa!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mweye momwidika, ‘Tuja na kung'wa hamoja na gweye, na gweye kutufundiza kudibuga jetu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini heyo kolonga kabili, ‘Sikujuwile kumulawa! Segeleni kumwangu, mweye mose mutenda nzambi!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Baho molila na kudafuna meno mwahawona Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo na watula ndagu wose wa Mulungu muundewa wa Mulungu, kuno mweye wenyego mwasigwa kunze! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wanhu wokwiza kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa na mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, kulawa mwambu wa kasikazini na mwambu wa kusini, wokala hasi muulujo muundewa wa Mulungu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu waja weli wa ikimambukizo sambi wokuwa wa ichanduso, na waja weli wa ichanduso sambi wokuwa wa ikimambukizo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koinogela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 23:37-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kipindi kikija Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Segela hanhu hano uchole hanhu hayagwe, kwavija Helode kolonda kukukoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Gendeni mkamulongele vino ija kizongo, ‘Nolava vinyamkela na kuhonya watamu lelo na mayo, na siku da kadatu nomambukiza sang'hano yangu!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hata avo lelo, mayo, na kisindo nogendelela na mwanza wangu, kwavija hailondeka mtula ndagu wa Mulungu yafile kunze ya buga Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Gweye Yelusalemu! Gweye Yelusalemu! Kowakoma watula ndagu wa Mulungu na kuwatowa kwa mabwe waja Mulungu yawatumile kumwako! Miyanza mingapi nilonda kuwahagata wanago kwa makono gangu, kamba vija nguku viyovihagata vinziya vake mna gamabawa gake, lakini hulondile bule! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sambi lola, Ng'anda yenu ya Mulungu ilekigwa vihame! Na niye nowalongela, hondamumbone kabili mbaka siku dija vondamulonge, ‘Mulungu yamtambikile ija yokwiza kwa twaga da Mndewa!’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu mtamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mwiisiku imoja ya Kubwihila, Yesu kachola kuja lujo mng'anda ya mkulu imoja wa Mafalisayo, wanhu wakala womulola goya Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Munhu imoja yakalile na utamu wa kuvimba lukuli keza kwa Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, “Vino, vinoga kumuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila hebu havinogile bule?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini wao hawalongile mbuli yoyose bule. Yesu kamsola mtamu ija, kamuhonya, abaho kamuleka yachole. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abaho kawauza, “Vino nani kumwenu yeli na mwana hebu ng'ombe, yahadumbukila mdikolombo mwiisiku ya Kubwihila, hamulava mwiisiku ayo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini wao hawadahile kumwidika mbuli ino.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhole na moyo unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawona wanhu waja wagonekigwe viwakalile wosagula vigoda va kuulongozi. Avo kawalongela wose lusimo luno, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Munhu yahakugoneka kuna idizengele, sekeukale mvigoda va haulongozi, kwavija kodaha kwiza munhu yagonekigwe yeli munhu mkulu kubanza gweye, <verse number="9" style="v"/>na munhu yawagoneke mose wabili kokwizila na kukulongela, ‘Segela aho haukalile umulekele miyago.’ Baho kogwa kinyala mgameso ga wanhu na kobwela kukala kuna ivigoda va kukisogo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini wahagonekigwa kuna ulujo, genda ukakale kuna ivigoda va kukisogo, muladi munhu yakugoneke yaheza yakulongele, ‘Mbwigangu, izo ukale kuna ivigoda va haulongozi.’ Baho kopata nhogolwa mgameso ga wanhu wose wagonekigwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwavija waja wose woitenda wenyego wanhu wakulu wotendigwa wanhu wadodo, na waja woitenda wenyego wanhu wadodo wotendigwa wanhu wakulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela ija yamgoneke, “Kamba kowatanda wanhu lujo lwa imisi hebu lwa ichungulo, sekeuwagoneke mbwiga zako, hebu ndugu zako, hebu matajili hebu wanhu welibehi na gweye. Kwavija wahatenda avo, wao nao wokugoneka na avo wokulipa vija viuwatendele wao. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini kamba wahatenda nyimwili nyimwili, wagoneke wakiwa,, mbetembete, waholole, na waja wasuwameso, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na gweye kotambikiligwa, kwavija awo hawadaha kukulipa. Mulungu kokulipa mwiisiku ya kuzilibuligwa kwa wanhu wanogile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa nyimwili nyimwili ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Munhu imoja mna iwaja wakalile muulujo viyahulike avo, kamulongela Yesu, “Wamweda waja wonda waje lujo lwa nyimwili nyimwili muundewa wa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu imoja katenda nyimwili nyimwili ng'hulu, kawagoneka wanhu wengi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Viivikile saa ya nyimwili nyimwili, kamtuma msang'hanaji wake yakawalongele wanhu wagonekigwe weze, kwavija kila kinhu kitandigwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini kila munhu kalava kitala chake. Munhu wa ichanduso kamulongela msang'hanaji ija, ‘Nigula mgunda, avo nolondeka nikaulole. Chonde, ndeka nyhole.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iyagwe kalonga, ‘Nigula ng'ombe longo wa kulimila, avo vino na muumwanza, nochola kuwageza. Chonde, ndeka nyhole.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iyagwe kalonga, ‘Sambi sambi nisola mwehe, avo sidaha kwiza.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Msang'hanaji ija kabwela na kumulongela mbuli zose zino mkulu wake. Mkulu wake kagevuzika ng'hani, kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lopola ugende mzinzila mhanda na mna gamabuga, uwagale hano wanhu wakiwa, waholole, wasuwameso na mbetembete.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bahaja msang'hanaji ija kamulongela, ‘Go mkulu, gago gose gasang'hanigwa, lakini kuna gati disigala.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Avo mkulu ija kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lawa kunze uchole mzinzila na mna gamakulugumbi ukawalongele wanhu weze, muladi ng'anda yangu imeme. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nowalongela kweli, kuduhu hata munhu imoja mna iwaja wagonekigwe walemile kwiza yonda yalanze lujo lwangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Kudununzika sama ya kuwa mwanahina</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 10:37-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Baho lunhu lwa wanhu vilukalile lomkweleleza, Yesu kahinduka, kawalongela, <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Munhu yoyose yokwiza kumwangu na kuno kowanogela ng'hani tatake na mamake na mwehe wake na wanage na lumbu zake na ndugu zake na vivija kamba kounogela ng'hani ugima wake mwenyego kubanza kumnogela Kilisito, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na munhu yoyose haupapa msalaba wake na kunikweleleza, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Vino nani kumwenu yahalonda kuzenga lingo, tanhu hakala hasi na kugelegeza sente za kudizengela, muladi yajuwe kamba kana sente za kumambukiza sang'hano yake? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Buleavo, yahamambukiza kuzenga chandusilo, kolemelwa kumambukiza kuzenga dilingo, na wose wachone acho kilawilile womseka, <verse number="30" style="v"/>wolonga, ‘Munhu ino kasonga kuzenga, lakini kalemelwa kumambukiza sang'hano yake!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Hebu mndewa gani yahaitanda kuchola kuitowa na mndewa iyagwe, tanhu hakala hasi na kugelegeza kamba heyo na wakalizi zake elufu kumi kodaha kuitowa na mndewa miyage yeli na wakalizi elufu ishilini? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kamba yahona hadaha, kowatuma wasenga zake wakaiting'hane na mndewa iyagwe, wampule wailumbe yang'hali kutali.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Vivo ili kumwenu, kuduhu munhu yodaha kuwa mwanahina wangu mbaka yaleke kila kinhu kiyali nacho.</para>
  <para style="s">Mkele ubanangike</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 5:13; Mlk 9:50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mkele unoga, lakini wahagiza ukali wake, kuduhu nzila ya kuubweza kabili. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Haufaya kwa isi hebu mna imbolea, lakini wokwasigwa. Yeli na magwiti yahulike!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa ng'hondolo yapotele</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 18:12-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siku dimoja wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wayagwe wotenda nzambi wachola kumtegeleza Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wasonga kunung'unika, “Munhu ino kowabokela wanhu wotenda nzambi na kuja nao!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Vino kamba imoja wenu kana ng'hondolo gana, abaho ng'hondolo imoja kapotela, vino kotenda choni? Kowaleka waja malongo tisa na tisa kuluwala, na kuchola kumzahila ija yapotele mbaka yampate. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yahampata, kodeng'helela na kumwika mmaega gake, <verse number="6" style="v"/>na kumgala ukae. Abaho kowakema hamoja mbwiga zake na wanhu weli behi nayo na kowalongela, ‘Miyenu nodeng'helela kwavija nimpata ng'hondolo wangu yapotele. Avo tudeng'helele hamoja!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nowalongela, avo vondaiwe, hokuwa na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu kuulanga mbuli ya munhu imoja mwene nzambi yahaleka nzambi zake, kubanza waja malongo tisa na tisa wogesa wanoga na hawalonda kuzileka nzambi zao.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa sente ipotele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Hebu mtwanzi yeli na sente longo yahagiza imoja, kotendaze? Kobwinha taa, kofagila ng'anda yake, na kulola goya kila hanhu mbaka yaipate. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yahaipata, kowakema hamoja mbwiga zake na wanhu weli behi yake, kowalongela, ‘Nodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija niipata sente yangu ipotele. Avo tudeng'helele hamoja!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vivija nowalongela, wasenga wa Mulungu wodeng'helela mbuli ya munhu imoja mwene nzambi yahaleka nzambi zake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mwana yapotele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na wana wabili. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ija imdodo kamulongela tatake, ‘Tata, nigwelele uhazi wangu sambi.’ Avo munhu ija kawagolela uhazi wao wanage awo wabili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi, ija imdodo kachuuza uhazi wake. Abaho kafunga mwanza na sente ziyapatile, kachola isi ya kutali, ako kazinanga sente zose ziyapatile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kamambukiza kila kinhu kiyakalile nacho. Abaho lufilili lwa nzala lulawilila mwiisi ija, nayo kakala kaduhu kinhu chochose kisigale. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Avo kachola kusang'hana kibaluwa kwa munhu imoja wa isi ija, munhu ayo kamtuma mumgunda wake yasusile nguluwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kakala kosulukila kuja maganda gawadile nguluwe, lakini kuduhu munhu yamgwelele kinhu chochose cha kuja. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abaho kagelegeza na kulonga, ‘Tatangu kana wasang'hanaji wengi, woja mbaka wosigaza na niye hano nofa na nzala! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nosegela na kuchola kwa tatangu na kumulongela, Tata, nimtenda Mulungu nzambi, na vivija nikutendela gweye nzambi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sifaya kukemigwa mwanago. Nhende kamba imoja wa wasang'hanaji zako.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avo kafunga mwanza wa kubwela kwa tatake.</para>
  <para style="p">“Viyakalile yang'hali kutali, tatake kamona. Kamonela bazi mwanage, avo kamkimbilila, kamuhagatila na kamnonela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwanage kamulongela, ‘Tata, nimtenda Mulungu nzambi, na vivija nikutendela gweye. Sifaya kukemigwa mwanago.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini tatake kawakema wasang'hanaji zake. Kawalongela, ‘Lopoleni! Galeni kiwalo kinogile mumvaze. Mvazeni pete mkidole chake na vilatu mmagulu gake. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho choleni mumgale bofu da ng'ombe dinonile mudichinje, wose tuje na kudeng'helela! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwavija mwanangu ino kakala yafile lakini sambi mgima. Kakala yapotele lakini sambi koneka.’ Avo wasonga kudeng'helela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kipindi acho mwanage imkulu kakala kumgunda. Viyakalile behi na ing'anda, kahulika nyila na wanhu wovina. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Avo kamkema msang'hanaji imoja, kamuuza, ‘Ako kuna choni?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kamwidika, ‘Mdodo wako kabwela ukae, na tatako kamchinjila bofu da ng'ombe dinonile, kwavija kabwela mgima!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ija imwana mkulu kagevuzika ng'hani, avo kalema kwingila mng'anda. Tatake kalawa kunze na kumpula yengile mng'anda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini kamwidika tatake, ‘Lola, miyaka yose ino niye nokusang'hanila kamba msang'hanaji, na silemile lagizo jako jojose. Kungwaa choni? Hunigwelele hata mbuzi nideng'helele na mbwiga zangu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini mwanago ino kananga vinhu vako mbuli ya ugoni, na viyabwelile ukae kumchinjila bofu da ng'ombe dinonile!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tatake kamwidika, ‘Mwanangu, kipindi chose kukala na niye, na vinhu vose vinilinavo vako. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini tulondeka tudeng'helele na kusekelela, kwavija mdodo wako kakala yafile lakini sambi mgima, kakala yapotele lakini sambi koneka!’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mulolesaji mbala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kukala na tajili imoja yakalile na mulolesaji wa vinhu vake. Tajili ayo kalongeligwa kamba mulolesaji ayo konanga sente zake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Avo kamkema mng'anda, kamuuza, ‘Mbuli gani zimhulika kumwako? Mhetela vinhu vose viubokele na vija viulavile, kwavija hudaha kuwa mulolesaji wa vinhu vangu kabili.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mulolesaji ija kailongela, ‘Mkulu wangu konilekesa usang'hano. Notenda choni? Kulima sidahile bule, na kupula nokona kinyala. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sambi nojuwa choni chonda nhende muladi nahalavigwa mna isang'hano, niwe na mbwiga wa kunibokela mzikae zao!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Avo kawakema wanhu wose wakalile wodaigwa na mkulu wake. Kamuuza wa ichanduso, ‘Kodaigwa choni na mkulu wangu?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nayo kamwidika, ‘Madebe gana ga mavuta.’ Mulolesaji ija kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, kala hasi, lopola wandike malongo matano.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Abaho kamuuza iyagwe, ‘Na gweye kodaigwa choni?’ Nayo kamwidika, ‘Viloba gana va ngano.’ Mulolesaji ija kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, wandike malongo nane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Mkulu wa ija mulolesaji mbala kamtogola kwavija katenda vinhu kwa ubala. Kwavija wanhu wa mwiisi ino wabala ng'hani mna zimbuli zao kubanza wanhu wa kumulenge.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Avo nowalongeleni, itendeleni umbwiga kubitila vinhu va mwiisi, muladi vahamala mudahe kubokeligwa kuna ikae ya ugima wa mazuwa gose. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yotamaniligwa mna ivinhu vidodo, kotamaniligwa mna ivinhu vikulu. Na munhu yoyose hatamaniligwa mna ivinhu vidodo, vivija hatamaniligwa mna ivinhu vikulu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Avo kamba mweye hamutamaniligwa kulolesa mali za mwiisi, modahaze kutamaniligwa kulolesa mali za kuulanga? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na kamba hutamaniligwa kulolesa vinhu va munhu iyagwe, nani yonda yakugwee vinhu vako mwenyego?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kuduhu msang'hanaji yodaha kuwasang'hanila wakulu wabili. Kwavija komwihila imoja na kumnogela iyagwe, hebu koilumba na imoja na kumbeza iyagwe. Hamudaha kumsang'hanila Mulungu hamoja na mali.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi uyagwe wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 11:12-13; 5:31-32; Mlk 10:11-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mafalisayo viwazihulike mbuli zino zose, wamzeha Yesu, kwavija wakala wanogelwa na sente. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye awo wanhu muitenda munoga mgameso ga wanhu, lakini Mulungu kaijuwa mizoyo yenu. Kwavija vinhu vikoneka vinoga ng'hani kwa wanhu, mgameso ga Mulungu vokoneka viha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Malagizo ga Musa na maandiko ga watula ndagu wa Mulungu vikala vipetigwa mbaka kipindi cha Yohana Mbatizaji. Kusongela aho, Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Mulungu yopetigwa, na kila munhu kowamba kokwingila. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini vibuha ng'hani kwa ulanga na isi kupotela, kubanza kinhu kidodo ng'hani kupotela mna Gamalagizo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mbigalo yoyose yomwasa mwehe wake na kusola mtwanzi iyagwe, kotenda ugoni. Na mbigalo yomsola mtwanzi ija yasigwe, nayo kotenda ugoni vivija.</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kukala na tajili imoja yavalile viwalo va sente nyingi ng'hani na kuja goya kila siku. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vivija kukala na munhu imoja mkiwa yakemigwe Lazalo, kamema vilonda lukuli lose, kakala yokwikigwa muulwivi lwa tajili ija. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lazalo kakala yosulukila kuja vilagale muimeza ya tajili ayo. Na umbwa wakala wokwiza na kumulambita mvilonda vake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Abaho mkiwa ija kafa na kasoligwa na wasenga wa kuulanga mbaka behi ya Abulahamu. Tajili ayo nayo kafa na kazikigwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ako kowochola wanhu wafile, kakala kodununzika ng'hani. Kenula meso gake, kamona Abulahamu kwa kutali na Lazalo kakala behi yake. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Avo kamkema kwa sauti ng'hulu, ‘Tata Abulahamu! Nyonele bazi! Mtume Lazalo yazabike kidole chake mgamazi, yaluhoze lulimi lwangu, kwavija nogaya ng'hani muumoto uno!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Lakini Abulahamu kamulongela, ‘Mwanangu, kumbuka muugima wako kubokela vinhu vinogile, nayo Lazalo kabokela vihile. Lakini sambi Lazalo kobwihila, na gweye kodununzika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hata avo, hagati yetu tweye na mweye hekigwa kolombo kulu, muladi munhu yolonda kuloka kulawa kuno kwiza kumwenu sekeyadahe, hebu munhu yoyose kulawa kumwenu sekeyaloke kwiza kumwetu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tajili ija kalonga, ‘Nokupula gweye, tata Abulahamu, umtume Lazalo kuna ikae ya tatangu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ako kuna ndugu zangu watano. Muleke yachole yakawazume muladi sekeweze hanhu hano ha kudununzika!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Abulahamu kalonga, ‘Ndugu zako wanago maandiko ga Musa na ga watula ndagu wa Mulungu ga kuwazuma. Wawategeleze wao kiwolonga!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tajili ija kamwidika, ‘Bule tata Abulahamu! Lakini kamba munhu yahazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile na kuwacholela, baho wozileka nzambi zao!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini Abulahamu kamulongela, ‘Kamba hawagagoga maandiko ga Musa na watula ndagu wa Mulungu, honda wategeleze hata kamba munhu yahazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile!’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 18:6-7, 21-22; Mlk 9:42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Vinhu vondaviwatende wanhu watende nzambi volawilila, lakini kogaya munhu ija yovitenda vilawilile! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yokuwa vinoga kwa munhu ayo yagodekigwe dibwe kulu da kudugila msingo na yasigwe mbahali, kubanza kumuhonza imoja wa wadodo wano yatende nzambi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Avo iteganyeni!</para>
  <para style="p">“Ndugu yako yahakutendela nzambi, umzume. Yahatogola, gela kumgongo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yahakutendela nzambi miyanza saba kwa siku dimoja, na kila yaheza kumwako kolonga, ‘Ng'hosa,’ kolondeka ugele kumgongo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tamanilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Watumigwa wamulongela Mndewa, “Twengezele tamanilo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mndewa kawedika, “Maza tamanilo jenu dahakuwile dodo kamba mbeyu ndodo ya haladali, mwahadahile kuulongela mbiki uno wa mkuyu, ‘Ng'oka ukaihande mbahali!’ nao wahawatogolele.</para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya msang'hanaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Vino nani kumwenu yeli na msang'hanaji yomulimila hebu kosusila ng'hondolo, yahabwela kumgunda, komulongela yalopole kuja lujo lwake? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bule. Lakini komulongela, ‘Uitande, nitandile lujo lwangu, unisang'hanile mbaka ng'homeleze kuja na kung'wa, abaho na gweye koja na kung'wa.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vino komgwaa nhogolwa msang'hanaji ayo kwavija kasang'hana gaja galagilizigwe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vivo ili kumwenu mweye, mwahatenda vose vimulagilizigwe, longeni, ‘Tweye twa wasang'hanaji wadodo, tusang'hana kija kitulondigwe kusang'hana!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile mnzila kochola Yelusalemu, kabitila mzimbaka za vijiji va Samalia na Galilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Viyakalile kokwingila mna ikijiji kimoja, mumo kukala na wanhu longo wakalile na utamu wa dikulu, wemile kutali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Waguta, “Go mkulu! Yesu! Tonele bazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kawona, kawalongela, “Gendeni mkailaguse kwa walava nhosa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Viwakalile mnzila wochola, wahona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imoja wao viyone kahona, kabweleganya kwa Yesu kuno komgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kamgwila Yesu mmagulu kingubanguba, kamtogola. Munhu ayo kakala Msamalia. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Vino hawakalile wanhu longo wahonyigwe? Wayagwe tisa wa kwahi? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vino kuduhu iyagwe yabwelile kumgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, ila munhu ino hali muyahudi?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela munhu ija, “Ima na uchole. Kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Undewa wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:23-28, 37-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamuuza Yesu Undewa wa Mulungu vondawize. Yesu kawedika, “Undewa wa Mulungu hawiza kwa kukoneka kwa meso. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuduhu munhu yonda yalonge, ‘Lola, uno hano!’ hebu ‘Uja haja!’ Kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu wa mgati mmwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kipindi chokwiza vonda mulonde kuyona siku imoja mwiizisiku za Mwana wa Munhu, lakini hondamuyone bule. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Baho wanhu wowalongela, ‘Loleni kakuja!’ hebu ‘Loleni, kahano!’ Sekemuwakweleleze. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwavija kamba vija lumwesa vilulawilila kuulanga na kumwemwesa kulawa mwambu umoja mbaka mwambu uyagwe, vivo vondayawe Mwana wa Munhu mwiisiku yake. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini tanhu kolondeka yadununzike ng'hani na kulemigwa na wanhu wa lukolo luno. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamba viikalile mna ikipindi cha Nuhu, vivo vondaiwe mzisiku za Mwana wa Munhu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kila munhu kakala koja na kung'wa, kusola na kusoligwa mbaka siku ija Nuhu viyengile mdisafina. Mvula ng'hulu itowa na kuwakoma wanhu wose. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vivija kamba viilawilile mna ikipindi cha Lutu. Wanhu wagendelela kuja na kung'wa, kugula na kuchuuza, kuhanda na kuzenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini siku ija Lutu viyasegele Sodoma, moto na mabwe gokwaka vilagala hasi na kuwakoma wose. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vivo vondaiwe mwiisiku Mwana wa Munhu vonda yagubuligwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Mwiisiku ayo, munhu yeli mkiswili cha ng'anda yake sekeyahumuluke mng'anda kusola vinhu vake, vivija munhu yeli kumgunda sekeyabwele ukayake. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kumbukeni gampatile mwehe wake Lutu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yolonda kuukombola ugima wake mwenyego, kowagiza, na yoyose yowagiza ugima wake, koukombola. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nowalongela, kilo acho wanhu wabili wawasile mulusazi lumoja, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Watwanzi wabili woduga sembe hamoja, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wanhu wabili wokuwa kumgunda, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Vino, kwahi Mndewa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Kokose kuli na mzoga, baho honda waiting'hane mhungu.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mgane na msemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawafundiza wanahina zake kwa lusimo kamba siku zose wolondeka kumpula Mulungu na sekewadonhe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Kudibuga dimoja kukala na msemi yakalile hamdumba Mulungu hebu kuwatonga wanhu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vivija kudibuga dijo, kukala na mgane imoja yakalile komgendela msemi ayo baho kwa baho, kampula, ‘Ngwelele haki yangu kulawa kwa munhu yanitendele gehile.’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Siku nyingi msemi ayo hamtegeleze mgane ayo, lakini kumwande kailongela, ‘Hata kamba simdumba Mulungu hebu kuwatonga wanhu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>lakini kwavija mgane ino konigaza, nomgwaa haki yake, kwavija nahaleka, kogendelela kwiza hano na kunigaza!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abaho Mndewa kagendelela kulonga, “Tegelezeni kiyalongile msemi ija yehile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vino, Mulungu honda yawagwee haki wanhu zake yawasagule, womulilila imisi na ikilo? Vino kokawa kuwategeleza? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nowalongela, kowagwaa haki yao himahima. Lakini Mwana wa Munhu vondayeze, vino kodivika tamanilo mwiisi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa Mfalisayo na mbokela kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno wanhu waja wakalile woitapa wanoga na kuwabeza wayagwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Kukala na wanhu wabili wacholile kumpula Mulungu kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu. Imoja kakala Mfalisayo na iyagwe kakala mbokela kodi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mfalisayo ayo kainega kumgwazo na kumpula Mulungu, ‘Go Mulungu, nokugwaa nhogolwa kwavija niye sili kamba wanhu wayagwe, wabokaji, wotenda gehile, hebu wagoni. Wala sili kamba ino mbokela kodi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niye nofunga kuja miyanza mibili mzisiku saba, na nolava fungu da longo da vinhu vangu vose vinipata!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Lakini ija mbokela kodi kema kutali, hadahile hata kwinula meso gake kuulanga, lakini kaitowa mhambaga yake kwa usungu, kalonga, ‘Go Mulungu, nyonele bazi, niye notenda nzambi!’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nowalongela, mbokela kodi ija kachola ukayake kuno katendigwa kanoga mgameso Mulungu kubanza ija Mfalisayo. Kwavija wose woitenda wanhu wakulu wohumulusigwa, na waja woihumulusa wotendigwa wanhu wakulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatambikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 19:13-15; Mlk 10:13-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo yawekile makono. Wanahina viwone avo, wawakomhokela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawakema iwana, kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, sekemuwagomese, kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu wa wanhu kamba wano. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli! Munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela Undewa wa Mulungu kamba mwana mdodo, honda yengile ng'o!”</para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 19:16-30; Mlk 10:17-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mkulu imoja kamuuza Yesu, “Mfundiza Unogile, nhende choni niupate ugima wa mazuwa gose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Habali kong'hema, ‘unogile’? Kuduhu yanogile, ila Mulungu yaiyeka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kugajuwa Malagizo, ‘Sekeutende ugoni, sekeukome, sekewibe, sekeulonge uvizi, wategeleze tatako na mamako.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Munhu ija kedika, “Gago gose nigagoga toka haudodo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu viyahulike avo, kamulongela, “Kuhungukiligwa na kinhu kimoja. Chuuza vose viulinavo, uwagwee sente wanhu wakiwa, na gweye kokuwa na ngama yako kuulanga. Abaho wize unikweleleze.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini munhu ayo viyahulike avo, kanyunyuwala kwavija kakala tajili ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu viyamone kanyunyuwala, kalonga, “Vino avo vonda iwe vidala kwa wanhu matajili kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwavija vibuha kwa ngamiya kubita mna ikizonzo cha sanzia, kubanza tajili kwingila muundewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wanhu wamuhulike, wamuuza, “Avo lelo nani yonda yadahe kukomboligwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vinhu havidahika kwa wanhu, kwa Mulungu vodahika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Abaho Petulo kalonga, “Lola! Tweye tuvileka vinhu vetu vose, tukukweleleza gweye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yoleka kae yake hebu mwehe wake hebu ndugu zake hebu tatake na mamake hebu wanage mbuli ya Undewa wa Mulungu, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kobokela vinhu vingi ng'hani mna ikipindi kino na kobokela ugima wa mazuwa gose mna ikipindi chonda kize.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwakadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 20:17-19; Mlk 10:32-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawagala hamgwazo wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela, “Tegelezeni! Tochola Yelusalemu. Kuko kila kinhu chandikigwe na watula ndagu wa Mulungu mbuli ya Mwana wa Munhu cholawilila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwavija kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu haweli Wayahudi, nao womzeha, womuliga, na womtemela mate. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Womtowa mbalati na kumkoma, lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini wanahina hawazijuwile bule mbuli azo, kwavija wakala wafisigwe na hawakijuwile kija kiyakalile yokilonga Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 20:29-34; Mlk 10:46-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile behi na kuvika Yeliko, munhu imoja yakalile msuwameso kakala hamgwazo mnzila, kopula. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Munhu ayo viyahulike lunhu lwa wanhu lobita, kauza, “Kuna choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wanhu wamulongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nayo kakemelela, “Yesu! Mwana wa Daudi! Nyonele bazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wanhu walongole wamkomhokela, wamulongela yanyamale. Lakini heyo kagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, “Mwana wa Daudi! Nyonele bazi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Avo Yesu kema, kalagiza munhu ija yagaligwe kumwake. Viyavikile behi, Yesu kamuuza, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Kolonda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayo kamwidika, “Go mkulu, nolonda kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lola! Kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bahaja munhu ija kadaha kulola, kamkweleleza Yesu kuno komgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu. Wanhu wose viwone avo, wamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kachola kudibuga da Yeliko, na kakala yobita mzinzila za buga dijo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuko kukala na mkulu imoja wa wabokela kodi yakemigwe Zakayo, nayo kakala tajili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kakala kolonda kumona Yesu, lakini hadahile mbuli ya lunhu lwa wanhu na kwavija kakala mguhi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Avo kakimbila haulongozi wa lunhu luja, kakwela mumbiki wa mkuyu muladi yamone Yesu, yakalile yochola kubitila nzila ija. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu viyavikile hanhu aho, kalola uchanha, kamulongela, “Zakayo, himahima humuluka hasi, kwavija lelo nolondeka kukala mng'anda yako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zakayo kahumuluka himahima, kamgoneka Yesu kwa kudeng'helela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wagone ago, wasonga kunung'unika, walonga, “Munhu ino kachola kukala mng'anda ya munhu mwene nzambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Zakayo kema, kamulongela Yesu, “Go Mkulu, tegeleza! Nowagwaa wakiwa nusu ya vinhu vangu, na kamba nimboka munhu yoyose kinhu, nombwezela miyanza mine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lelo ukombozi uvika kwa wanhu wa lubuga luno, kwavija munhu ino nayo kolawa mulukolo lwa Abulahamu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu keza kuwazahila na kuwakombola waja wapotele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa wasang'hanaji longo</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 25:14-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wanhu viwakalile wotegeleza gago, Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela lusimo. Baho kakala mmabehi na Yelusalemu, nao wagesa kamba Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmabehi kulawilila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Avo kawalongela, “Kukala na munhu imoja wa lukolo lwa kindewa yafungile mwanza kuchola isi ya kutali yakatendigwe mndewa, abaho yabwele ukayake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Avo yang'hali hanasegela, kawakema wasang'hanaji zake longo, kila imoja kamgwaa sente sawa, abaho kawalongela, ‘Tendeni biashala mbaka vondambwele.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini wanhu wa isi yake wakala wamwihile. Avo wawatuma wasenga wagende kwa wanhu waja wakalonge, ‘Hatumulonda munhu ino yawe mndewa wetu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Munhu ija kaupata undewa, kabwela ukayake. Baho kawalagiza wasang'hanaji zake yawagwelele sente wachole kumwake yapate kujuwa kija kiwapatile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Msang'hanaji wa ichanduso keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sente zako ziunigwelele zilela miyanza longo.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kamulongela, ‘Kutenda goya msang'hanaji unogile! Kwavija kutenda vinogile kulolesa mna ivinhu vidodo, nokutenda uwe munhu mkulu wa mabuga longo.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Msang'hanaji wa kabili keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sente zako ziunigwelele zilela miyanza mitano.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nayo kamulongela, ‘Kokuwa munhu mkulu wa mabuga matano.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Msang'hanaji iyagwe keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sola sente zako. Nikala nizifungile goya mkikumbi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nikudumba, kwavija kuna gahigahi. Kosola vinhu va wayago kwa uvizi na kosenga vija huvihandile.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mkulu ija kamulongela, ‘Gweye kwa msang'hanaji yehile! Nokutagusa kwa mbuli zako mwenyego! Kunijuwa nina gahigahi, nisolaga vinhu va wayangu na kusenga vija sivihandile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Habali huzikile sente zangu kwa wanhu wokwika sente muladi vimbwelile nyambulile zongezeke?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Abaho kawalongela waja wemile aho, ‘Mbokeni ayo zisente, mumgwelele msang'hanaji ija yapatile sente miyanza longo ya zija ziyagweleligwe.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini wao wamulongela, ‘Go mkulu, lakini heyo kanazo sente miyanza longo!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nayo kawedika, ‘Munhu yeli na kinhu kokongezelwa, lakini ija yeliduhu kinhu, kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyelinacho. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na sambi, waja wanihile, wondema niye niwe mndewa wao, wagaleni hano, muwakome bahano mgameso gangu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa deng'ho</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:1-11; Mlk 11:1-11; Yoh 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga avo, kawalongolela kuchola Yelusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Viyakalile behi na kuvika Betifage na Betania, habehi na Lugongo lwa Mizeituni, kawatuma wanahina zake wabili, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Gendeni kuna ikijiji kili kuulongozi wenu. Mwahengila, momvika mwana mhunda kafungigwa, nayo yang'hali hanakweligwa na munhu. Mfunguleni mumgale hano.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Mwana mhunda</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yahawauza habali momfungula, mulongeleni, ‘Mndewa komulonda.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wanahina waja wachola, wamvika kamba vija Yesu viyawalongele. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Viwakalile womfungula imwana mhunda, wenyego wawauza, “Habali momfungula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nao wawedika, “Mndewa komulonda.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wamgala imwana mhunda kwa Yesu. Abaho watandika viwalo vao mumgongo wa imwana mhunda, na wamtaza Yesu kukwela. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile kochola, wanhu wanzanza viwalo vao mnzila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Viyakalile behi na kuvika Yelusalemu, hanhu hali na mtelemuko wa Lugongo lwa Mizeituni, lunhu mkulu lwa wanahina zake lusonga kudeng'helela na kumgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu mbuli ya unzonza wauwonile. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Walonga, “Mulungu yamtambikile Mndewa yokwiza kwa twaga da Mulungu, tindiwalo kuulanga na ukulu kwa Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Baho Mafalisayo wayagwe wakalile muulunhu wamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, walagize wanahina zako wanyamale!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongeleni, wahanyamala wano, mabwe goguta.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalilila wanhu wa buga da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu viyavikile behi na buga da Yelusalemu na viyawone wanhu wa buga dijo, kawalilila, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kalonga, “Maza lelo mwahajuwile mbuli zilondeka kugala tindiwalo! Lakini sambi zifisigwa mgameso genu! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kwavija kipindi chokwiza, wanhu wakwihile vonda wakuzengele luwa, wokuzunguluka na kukusung'ha sung'ha kila mwambu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Wokuhondahonda gweye na wanhu zako weli muuluwa wako. Kuduhu hata dibwe dimoja donda disigazigwe uchanha ya diyagwe, kwavija hukijuwile kipindi kiyezile Mulungu kukukombola!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Mng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:12-17; Mlk 11:15-19; Yoh 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kengila Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kasonga kuwawinga wanhu wakalile wochuuza vinhu, <verse number="46" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, Mulungu kalonga, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokuwa ng'anda ya kupulila.’ Lakini mweye muitenda mhango ya wabavi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kila siku Yesu kakala kofundiza Mng'anda ya Mulungu. Wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, na walangulizi wa wanhu walonda kumkoma, <verse number="48" style="v"/>lakini hawadahile bule kutenda avo, kwavija wanhu wose wakala womtegeleza goya, hawalondile kuswela mbuli.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:23-27; Mlk 11:27-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala Mng'anda ya Mulungu kowafundiza wanhu na kuwapetela Mbuli Inogile. Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa hamoja na wavele weza, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wamulongela, “Tulongele, vino kotenda mbuli zino kwa udahi wa nani? Nani yakugwelele udahi uno?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Beteni na niye niwauze mbuli imoja. Nongeleni, <verse number="4" style="v"/>vino udahi wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kuulanga hebu kwa wanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wagesa, “Tulonge choni? Twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kuulanga,’ kotuuza, ‘Habali, hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ lunhu lose luno lotutowa mabwe, kwavija wose wotogola kamba Yohana kakala mtula ndagu wa Mulungu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Avo wamwidika, “Hatujuwile kuulawile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Na niye siwalongela bule notenda mbuli zino kwa udahi wa nani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa walimaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 21:33-46; Mlk 12:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanhu lusimo luno, “Kukala na munhu imoja yahandile mizabibu mumgunda wake. Kawakodisha walimaji, abaho kachola mwiisi iyagwe na kakala siku nyingi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Msimu wa kubawa zabibu viuvikile, munhu ija kamtuma msang'hanaji wake yachole kwa walimaji wamgwelele zabibu. Lakini walimaji waja wamtowa msang'hanaji ija, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Avo kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, lakini walimaji wamtowa vivija na kumuliga, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Abaho kamtuma msang'hanaji wa kadatu. Ino nayo walimaji wamulumiza, wamwasa kunze. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Abaho mwene mgunda ija kalonga, ‘Nhende choni? Nomtuma mwanangu nimnogele. Lamda ino womtegeleza!’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini walimaji viwamone, wailongela, ‘Ino ayo muhazi wake. Tumkome na uhazi wake wokuwa wetu.’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Avo wamulava kunze ya mgunda uja, wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawauza, “Vino, mwene mgunda kowatenda choni waja walimaji? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kokwiza na kuwakoma walimaji wose awo na kowakodisha walimaji wayagwe mgunda awo wa mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wanhu viwahulike mbuli ayo, walonga, “Bule! Sekeilawilile avo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawalola, kawauza, “Vino, ulonzi uno fambulo jake choni?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Dibwe wadilemile wazengaji kamba hadifaya,</para>
  <para style="q">digalamuka dibwe kulu da kutamanila kubanza gose!’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yaikwale mdibwe ajo kobeneka beneka munhu donda dimulagalile domuhonda tipitipi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kulipa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:15-22; Mlk 12:13-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wakulu wa walava nhosa wajuwa kamba lusimo ulo kakala kowafumbila wao. Avo bahaja walonda kumgoga Yesu, lakini wawadumba wanhu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Avo wazahila kipindi kinogile. Wawahonga wanhu wayagwe waitende wanoga, wawatuma wamgeze Yesu kwa kumuuza, muladi wadahe kumgoga na kumgala kwa mkulu wa Lumi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wanhu awo wamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, tokujuwa gweye kofundiza na kulonga ukweli, wala hutonga ukulu wa munhu, lakini kofundiza nzila za Mulungu mna ikweli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tulongele, vino vinoga kulipa kodi kwa mndewa mkulu wa Lumi hebu havinogile bule?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kaujuwa mwaka ubala wao, kawalongela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ndagusileni isente. Vino, kihanga kino na twaga dino va nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Va mndewa mkulu wa Lumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vinoga. Vinhu va mndewa wa Lumi mgweleleni mndewa wa Lumi, na va Mulungu mgweleleni Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Avo, mgameso ga wanhu hawadahile kumgoga kwa mbuli yoyose. Wakanganya ulonzi wake, wanyamala huupi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wafile</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:23-33; Mlk 12:18-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Abaho Masadukayo, wanhu wolonga kamba kuduhu kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. Wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mfundiza, Musa katwandikila, ‘Munhu yahafa na kuleka mwehe wake bila wana, ndugu yake munhu ayo kolondeka yamsole imgane, yamulelele ndugu yake yafile wana.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kukala na ndugu saba. Ija imkulu kasola mwehe, lakini kafa bila kulela wana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wakabili kamsola mtwanzi ija, lakini nayo kafa bila wana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abaho wa kadatu kamsola. Vivo ilawilile kwa wose saba wamsola, lakini wafa bila wana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kukimambukizo, mtwanzi ija nayo kafa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lelo mwiisiku ya kuzilibuka, mtwanzi ayo kokuwa mwehe wa nani? Kwavija kakala yasoligwe na wose saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wanhu wa mwiisi ino wosola na kusoligwa, <verse number="35" style="v"/>lakini waja wasaguligwe kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile na kuupata ugima wondawize, hawasola hebu kusoligwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Woigala na wasenga wa kuulanga, na hondawafe bule. Wao ni wana wa Mulungu kwavija wazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lakini kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile, hata Musa kalagusa avo mna imbuli ya ikisolo kikwaka baho kamkema Mndewa, ‘Mulungu wa Abulahamu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Heyo ni Mulungu wa wanhu wagima, siyo wa wanhu wafile. Kwavija kumwake heyo wose wagima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe walonga, “Mfundiza, kulonga goya!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Avo hawadahile kumuuza mbuli ziyagwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kilisito Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 22:41-46; Mlk 12:35-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino habali wanhu wolonga kamba Kilisito Mkombola kolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwavija Daudi mwenyego kolonga mna ikitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Kala hano mwambu wangu wa mkono wa kudila,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>mbaka niwahume wanhu wakwihile na niweke</para>
  <para style="q">hasi mmagulu gako.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Daudi mwenyego kamkema ‘Mndewa.’ Yodahika vilihi Kilisito Mkombola yalawe mulukolo lwa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 23:1-36; Mlk 12:38-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wanhu wose viwakalile womtegeleza, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Muiteganye na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Wao wonogelwa kwanga kuno wavala mikanzu mitali, na kulamusigwa na wanhu mna gamagulilo na kukala mna ivigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na mna izinyimwili nyimwili. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wowonela wagane kwa kusola vinhu vao, na kuitenda wanoga kwa kumpula Mulungu kwa kulonga mbuli nyingi! Awo nhaguso yao yobanza ng'hani!”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mgane</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 12:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kenula meso gake kawona matajili viwogela nhunza zao mkigelo cha kulavila nhuza. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abaho kamona mgane mkiwa imoja kagela sente mbili ndodo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, mgane ino kalava kinhu kikulu kubanza wose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwavija matajili walava vija visigale muutajili wao, lakini mgane ino hamoja na ukiwa wake, kalava vose viyotamanila muugima wake.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangigwa kwa Ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:1-2; Mlk 13:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wanahina wayagwe wakala wolonga mbuli ya Ng'anda ya Mulungu, viizengigwe kwa mabwe ganogile na sadaka za wanhu zilavigwe kwa Mulungu. Lakini Yesu kalonga, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Mogona gano gose! Siku yokwiza kuduhu dibwe dondadisigale uchanha ya diyagwe, mabwe gose gobomoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:3-14; Mlk 13:3-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wamuuza, “Mfundiza, vinhu avo volawilila lini? Choni chondakitendeke kulagusa kipindi cha kulawilila vinhu avo cha mmabehi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Muiteganye, munhu sekeyawavizile. Kwavija wanhu wengi wokwiza kwa twaga jangu, na kulonga, ‘Niye ayo Kilisito!’ na ‘Kipindi cha mmabehi!’ Lakini sekemuwakweleleze. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwahahulika ng'hondo na zumozumo, sekemudumbe, kwavija vinhu avo volondeka tanhu vilawilile, lakini kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Wanhu wa isi imoja woitowa na wanhu wa isi iyagwe, undewa umoja woitowa na undewa uyagwe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kila hanhu hokuwa na migudemo mikulu ya isi, lufilili lwa nzala na mitamu, volawilila vinhu va kugela bwembwe na vilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini gang'hali haganalawila gano gose, mogogigwa na kudununzigwa. Mogaligwa mzing'anda za kumpula Mulungu na kuwagodeka mkifungo, mogaligwa haulongozi wa wandewa na wakulu wa isi mbuli ya twaga jangu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kino chokuwa kipindi chenu kinogile cha kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gangamaleni, sekemunyawenyawe mbuli ya vija vonda mwidike, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kwavija niye nowagwaa ubala na mbuli za kulonga. Kuduhu munhu mna iwanhu wamwihileni yodaha kuwahuma hebu kulema chonda mulonge. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mohindukigwa na tata zenu na mama zenu na ndugu zenu na wanhu wa mulukolo, na mbwiga zenu, na wayagwe vimwili wowakoma. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wowehila mweye mbuli ya twaga jangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini kuduhu hata luvili lumoja lwa mmapala genu londa lupotele. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwahagangamala, moihonya wenyego.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangigwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:15-21; Mlk 13:14-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Mwahajona buga da Yelusalemu dizungulukigwa na wakalizi, baho mujuwe kipindi cha kubanangigwa cha mmabehi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Baho, waja weli Yudea wakimbilile kuvigongo, waja weli kudibuga walawanye, waja weli kumigunda sekewabwele kudibuga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwavija kino acho kipindi cha nhaguso kutenda gaja gandikigwe galawilile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mna izisiku azo wogaya watwanzi wali na zinda na waja wokong'heza! Kwavija hokuwa na magayo ng'hani mwiisi, na ng'hasiliki ya Mulungu yokuwa mna iwanhu wano. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wayagwe wokomigwa kwa panga, na wayagwe wosoligwa na kugodekigwa mziisi zose, na wanhu haweli Wayahudi wodihondahonda buga da Yelusalemu, mbaka kipindi chao vonda kimale.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:29-31; Mlk 13:24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hokuwa na vilaguso mna dizuwa, mna umwezi, na mna zinhondo. Isi zose zokuwa mna ukugaya, wodumba mvumo wa bahali na ng'humbi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wanhu wosinduka kwa bwembwe, kwa kubetela chondakilawilile mwiisi, kwavija vinhu vili kuulanga votigisika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kipindi acho womona Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza, mna ga mawingu kwa nguvu ng'hulu na ukulu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Avo vinhu vino vahasonga kulawilila, mwime na mwinule mapala genu uchanha, kwavija kukomboligwa kwenu kwa mmabehi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 24:32-35; Mlk 13:28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Geseni mbiki wa mtini na mibiki yose iyagwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mwahagona majani gake gosonga kuzuka, mojuwa kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vivija, mwahavona vinhu avo volawilila, mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmabehi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wa lukolo luno hawafa wose mbaka gano gose galawilile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ulanga na isi vobita, lakini mbuli zangu hondazibite.</para>
  <para style="s">Kaleni meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Iteganyeni! Mizoyo yenu sekeigogigwe na unovu wa mwiisi ino, kukoligwa, na kugaya mbuli ya ugima uno, kwavija siku ayo yowasinhusa <verse number="35" style="v"/>kamba mtego. Kwavija yowezila wanhu wose wokala kila hanhu mwiisi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muiteganye na mupule siku zose, muladi mudahe kuhonyeka mna zimbuli zose zino zondazilawilile na kwima haulongozi wa Mwana wa Munhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kila siku Yesu kakala kofundiza Mng'anda ya Mulungu, na yahavika ichungulo, kacholaga kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni na kakala kuko kilo kigima. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imitootondo ng'hani wanhu wose wakala wochola kuna Ing'anda ya Mulungu kumtegeleza.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:1-5; Mlk 14:1-2; Yoh 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kipindi cha Nyimwili nyimwili da Magate hagageligwe Mela, kikemigwe Pasaka kikala behi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala wozahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lakini wawadumba wanhu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumuhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:14-16; Mlk 14:10-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwenembago kamkumba Yuda Isikaliote, imoja wa wanahina longo na wabili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yuda kachola kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa na wakulu wa wakalizi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu, kawalongela vija vonda yamuhinduke Yesu kumwao. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nao wadeng'helela na waitogolela kumgwaa sente. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda katogola, na kasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumgela Yesu mmakono gao kwa kinyelegezi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koitanda kuja lujo lwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:17-25; Mlk 14:12-21; Yoh 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Siku ya Magate hagageligwe Mela ivika. Siku ayo bofu da ng'hondolo da Pasaka dolavigwa nhosa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Avo Yesu kawatuma Petulo na Yohana, kawalongela, “Choleni mkatutandile lujo lwa Pasaka tuje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nao wamuuza, “Kolonda tukalutandile kwahi ulujo lwa Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwahengila kudibuga, mnzila momting'hana mbigalo yapapile nongo ya mazi. Mkwelelezeni mbaka mng'anda yonda yengile, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na mulongeleni mwene kae, ‘Mfundiza kokuuza, dakwahi gati dondanidile lujo lwa Pasaka niye na wanahina zangu?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nayo kowalagusila gati kulu da uchanha dihambigwe, mumo mtutandile kila kinhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wasegela wavika kila kinhu kamba vija Yesu viyawalongele, nao watanda lujo lwa Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Lujo lwa Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:26-30; Mlk 14:22-26; 1Kol 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Saa viivikile, Yesu kakala muulujo na watumigwa zake. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Nisulukila ng'hani kuja lujo luno lwa Pasaka hamoja na mweye ning'hali sinadununzika! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Avo nowalongela, honda nije kabili mbaka vonda ilawilile Muundewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kasola kikasi cha divai, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kalonga, “Soleni kino mung'wile mose. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nowalongela kulawa sambi, honda ning'we divai ino mbaka vondawize Undewa wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abaho kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kadibanzula, kawagwaa, kalonga, “Uno ulo lukuli lwangu, ulavigwe mbuli ya mweye. Tendeni vino kwa kung'humbuka niye.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vivija, viwamambukize kuja lujo lwa ichungulo, kawagwaa kikasi, kalonga, “Kino acho kikasi cha lagano da sambi dilagusigwa kwa damu yangu, ikwitika mbuli ya mweye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Lakini, loleni! Munhu yonihinduka kabahano na niye muulujo! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwana wa Munhu kofa kamba Mulungu viyalondile, lakini kogaya munhu ija yomuhinduka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abaho wasonga kuiuza, nani viweli yonda yatende vivo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuibamilila mbuli ya ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wanahina wakala woibamilila wao kwa wao nani yokoneka munhu mkulu kubanza wose. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Wandewa wa wanhu haweli Wayahudi wana udahi kwa wanhu, walangulizi woikema, ‘Mbwiga wa wanhu.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini kumwenu mweye haili vivo bule, munhu mkulu kumwenu yawe kamba munhu mdodo, na mulangulizi yawe kamba msang'hanaji. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vino, nani yeli munhu mkulu, ija yakalile mmeza koja, hebu ija yotanda ulujo? Ona, ayo ija yakalile mmeza koja. Lakini niye na hagati yenu kamba munhu yosang'hana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mweye mukala na niye kipindi chose cha kugezigwa kwangu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>kamba Tatangu viyanigwelele Undewa na niye nowagwaa Undewa awo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Moja na kung'wa mmeza yangu mna Undewa wangu, na mokala mna ivigoda va Undewa kugatawala makabila ga Izilaeli longo na mabili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula kamba Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:31-35; Mlk 14:27-31; Yoh 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Simoni, Simoni! Tegeleza! Mwenembago kampula Mulungu kuwageza mweye, kuwabagula wanogile na wehile, kamba vija mfolaji viyobagula fuya na hemba. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini nikupulila kwa Mulungu gweye Simoni, muladi kumtamanila kwako Mulungu sekekupotele. Na vondaunibwelele, uwagangamize ndugu zako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Mndewa, notogola kugodekigwa na gweye mkifungo na kufa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Petulo, nokulongela ukweli, kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela miyanza midatu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kipindi cha kugaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Vino, kipindi kija viniwatumile kuno mduhu kibindo hebu mkoba hebu vilatu, muhungukiligwa na kinhu chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Aka, hatuhungukiligwe na kinhu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Lakini sambi, munhu yoyose yeli na kibindo, hebu mkoba yausole, na munhu yoyose yeliduhu panga yakachuuze koti jake yakagule. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwavija nowalongela Maandiko Gang'alile galongile, ‘Kekigwa mdibumbila dimoja na wabananzi,’ golondigwa galawilile. Nowalongela, gaja gandikigwe mbuli ya niye golawilila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Wanahina walonga, “Mndewa, lola, hano hana mapanga mabili!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayo kawedika, “Gofaya!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kompula Mulungu kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:36-46; Mlk 14:32-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kasegela kudibuga dija kachola kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, kamba viyazowele, na wanahina zake wamkweleleza. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Viyavikile kuko, kawalongela, “Mpuleni Mulungu, sekemwingile mna ukugezigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Abaho kawaleka, kachola utali wa kwasa dibwe, kafugama, kampula Mulungu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kalonga, “Tata, wahalonda, unisegezele kikasi kino cha madununzo. Siyo kamba vinilonda niye, lakini kamba viulonda gweye.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kamulawilila, kamgangamiza. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwa usungu mkulu uyakalile nao kampula ng'hani, mbaka fuguti dimulawa, fuguti jake dikala kamba madondwe ga damu golagala hasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Viyamambukize kumpula Mulungu, kabwela kwa wanahina zake, kawavika wokuluza kwavija wakala wadonhile mbuli ya kunyunyuwala. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Habali mowasa? Lamukeni mumpule Mulungu, sekemwingile mna ukugezigwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:47-56; Mlk 14:43-50; Yoh 18:3-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, lunhu lwa wanhu luvika lulongozigwe na Yuda, imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili. Yuda kamcholela Yesu kamulamusa kwa kumnonela. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamulongela, “Yuda, komuhinduka Mwana wa Munhu kwa kumnonela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wanahina wakalile hamoja na Yesu viwonile gaja gonda galawilile, wauza, “Mndewa, tuwakanhe na mapanga getu?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Imoja wao kambiga kwa panga msang'hanaji wa Mkulu wa walava nhosa na kamkanha digwiti da mkono wa kudila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kalonga, “Bule sekemutende avo!” Kadikwasa digwiti da munhu ija, kamuhonya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wakulu wa walava nhosa na wakulu wa wakalizi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu na wavele wezile kumgoga, “Habali, mwiza kungoga kwa mapanga na malungu, kamba nambavi? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Siku zose ng'hala na mweye Mng'anda ya Mulungu hamngogile bule. Lakini kino acho kipindi chenu cha kusang'hana, muundewa wa ziza.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:57-58; Mlk 14:53-54, 66-72; Yoh 18:12-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Baho wamgoga Yesu, wengila nayo mng'anda ya mkulu wa walava nhosa. Petulo kamkweleleza kwa kutali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Wabwinha moto hagati hana uluwa, wakala hamoja na Petulo kakala hamoja nao. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Msang'hanaji imoja wa kitwanzi viyamone Petulo kakala aho haumoto, kamulola bunhuu, kalonga, “Vivija munhu ino kakala hamoja na Yesu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lakini Petulo kabela, kalonga, “Gwee, mtwanzi gwe, simjuwile bule!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Hamwande kidogo munhu iyagwe kamona Petulo, kalonga, “Vivija na gweye kwa imoja wao!”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini Petulo kamwidika “Gwee munhu gwe, siyo niye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Vidibitile saa dimoja, munhu iyagwe kagangamiza ng'hani, “Kweli munhu ino kakala hamoja na Yesu, kwavija nayo mwenekae wa Galilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Lakini Petulo kamwidika, “Munhu gweye, sikijuwile kiulonga!”</para>
  <para style="p">Bahaja, viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, nzogolo keka. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mndewa kahinduka, kamulola Petulo, nayo Petulo kakumbuka Mndewa viyamulongele, “Kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela miyanza midatu.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Petulo kalawa kunze kalila kwa usungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozehigwa na kutowigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:67-68; Mlk 14:65</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Wanhu wakalile womkaliza Yesu, wakala womzeha na kumtowa, <verse number="64" style="v"/>viwamgubike gameso na wamuuza, “Lagula! Nani yakutowile?” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Vivija walonga mbuli ziyagwe nyingi za kumuliga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa mkitala</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 26:59-66; Mlk 14:55-64; Yoh 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Imitondo yake, wavele, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa waiting'hana hamoja na Yesu kagaligwa mkitala acho. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Walonga, “Tulongele! Vino, gweye ayo Kilisito Mkombola?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Nahawalongela, honda munitogole bule, <verse number="68" style="v"/>na nahawauza mbuli, honda mwidike bule. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Lakini kusongela sambi, Mwana wa Munhu kokala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Mulungu yeli na Udahi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Wose walonga, “Vino gweye kwa Mwana wa Mulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Molonga, iyo niye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Walonga, “Hatulonda usindila uyagwe! Tweye wenyego tumuhulika viyalongile!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:1-2, 11-14; Mlk 15:1-5; Yoh 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu wose wenuka, wamgala Yesu kwa Pilato, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wasonga kumulavila vitala, walonga, “Tumvika munhu ino kowagiza wanhu zetu, kowagomesa wanhu sekewalipe kodi kwa mndewa mkulu wa Lumi na koikema heyo ayo Kilisito Mkombola na koikema Mndewa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Gweye ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, vivo viulonga,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abaho Pilato kawalongela wakulu wa walava nhosa na ulunhu lwa wanhu, “Siyonile mbuli ya kumtagusa munhu ino.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini wao wagangamiza ng'hani, walonga, “Kwa mafundizo gake kowading'hula wanhu wose wa mwiisi ya Yudea. Kasongela Galilaya na sambi keza hano.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilato viyahulike avo kauza, “Vino munhu ino mwenekae wa Galilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Viyajuwile kamba Yesu kalawa mwiisi ilongozigwa na Helode, kamgala kwa Helode, yakalile Yelusalemu kipindi acho. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Helode viyamone Yesu kadeng'helela ng'hani, kwavija kahulika mbuli zake na toka mwaka kakala yolonda kumona. Kakala kobetela kona unzonza utendigwa na Yesu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Avo Helode kamuuza Yesu mbuli nyingi, lakini hamwidike mbuli. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa walawilila kuulongozi wamulavila vitala Yesu vikulu vikulu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Helode na wakalizi zake wamzeha Yesu na kumwehula, abaho wamvaza kiwalo cha undewa wambweza kwa Pilato. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kipindi kikija Helode na Pilato wakala mbwiga, kwavija ako umwaka wakala waihile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotagusigwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:15-26; Mlk 15:6-15; Yoh 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato kawakema hamoja wakulu wa walava nhosa, walangulizi na wanhu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kawalongela, “Mumgala munhu ino kumwangu mulonga kakala kowagiza wanhu. Lelo nimuuza mgameso genu na siyonile mbuli yoyose ihile yumumtagusile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vivija Helode hachonile kiyabanange, lekaavo kambweza kumwetu. Kwavija kuduhu mbuli yoyose yaitendile munhu ino imtende yakomigwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Avo nolagiza yatoigwe mbalati na kumuleka yachole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chahavikaga kipindi cha Nyimwili nyimwili ya Pasaka, Pilato kalondeka yamfungulile mfungwa imoja. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lunhu lose lukemelela, “Mkome munhu ayo! Tufungulile Balaba!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Balaba kakala yagodekigwe mkifungo mbuli ya kuwading'hula wanhu kudibuga, na mbuli ya ukomaji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilato kalonda kumulekesa Yesu, avo kalulongela ulunhu kabili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini wagendelela kukemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba! Muwambe mumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato kawalongela mwanza wa kadatu, “Vino, mbuli gani ihile yaitendile munhu ino? Siyonile mbuli yoyose yaitendile munhu ino imtende yakomigwe! Nolagiza yatoigwe mbalati na kumulekesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, wolonga Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba, kukimambukizo nyangi zao zihuma. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Avo Pilato katogola kija kiwalondile kumtendela Yesu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kamfungulila munhu iwamulondile, ija yagodekigwe mbuli ya kuwading'hula wanhu na ukomaji, na kamgela Yesu mmakono gao wamtendele kamba viwalondile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:32-44; Mlk 15:21-32; Yoh 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wakalizi wamulongoza Yesu, viwakalile womgala, wamting'hana munhu imoja kulawa Kilene, twaga jake Simoni, kakala kolawa kumgunda, wamgoga wamdikwa umsalaba, na wamulagiza yaupape kukisogo cha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza, mmwanza awo wakala watwanzi wayagwe wakalile womulilila na kuiyalala. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kahinduka kawalongela, “Mweye kina mama wa Yelusalemu! Sekemunililile niye, lakini ililileni wenyego na wanenu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwavija kipindi chokwiza wanhu wolonga, ‘Wamweda watwanzi hawalelile wana na hawakong'heze!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kipindi acho wanhu wovilongela vigongo, ‘Tulagalile!’ na wovilongela visugulu, ‘Tufiseni!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>kwavija kamba wanhu wotenda mbuli zino kipindi mbiki ung'hali mbisi, vino yokuwaze kipindi mbiki wahanyala?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wanhu wabili wayagwe wakalile wabananzi, wagaligwa wakomigwe hamoja na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Viwavikile hanhu hakemigwe, “Fumvu da Pala,” wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, hamoja na waja wabananzi wabili, imoja mwambu wa mkono wake wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa mkono wake wa kumoso. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tata, gela kumgongo nzambi zao, kwavija hawakijuwa kiwotenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">Waigolela viwalo vake kwa kubwanha simbi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wanhu wema aho wolola, kuno wakulu wa Wayahudi womzeha Yesu, walonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, leka yaikombole mwenyego, kamba heyo ayo Kilisito, yasaguligwe na Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vivija wakalizi wamzeha, wamcholela wamgwaa divai ya ugwadu, <verse number="37" style="v"/>kuno wolonga, “Kamba gweye kwa Mndewa wa Wayahudi, ikombole mwenyego!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Uchanha ya msalaba wake wandika vino, “Ino ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Imoja wa waja wabananzi yawambigwe mumsalaba, kamuliga Yesu, kalonga, “Vino gweye siyo Kilisito Mkombola? Ikombole mwenyego na tweye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini ija iyagwe kamkomhokela miyage, kalonga, “Vino, gweye humdumba Mulungu bule? Na gweye kutagusigwa kamba heyo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Gweye na niye totagusigwa goya, kwavija tobokela fungu da sang'hano zetu, lakini munhu ino hatendile mbuli yoyose ihile.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Abaho munhu ija kamulongela Yesu, “Yesu, ung'humbuke wahengila Muundewa wako!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela ukweli, lelo kokuwa na niye Paladiso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:45-56; Mlk 15:33-41; Yoh 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ikala saa sita imisi, ziza diigubika isi yose mbaka saa tisa, <verse number="45" style="v"/>kwavija zuwa dileka kumwemwesa. Panziya da Ng'anda ya Mulungu digola gati da Ng'anda ya Mulungu na hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, didegeka mhande mbili. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Tata, noika mmakono gako loho yangu!” Viyalongile avo, kafa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mkulu wa wakalizi wa Lumi viyagone gago galawilile, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, kalonga, “Munhu ino kweli kakala yanogile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wakalile waiting'hane aho kulola mbuli azo, viwagone gago galawilile, wabwela ukayao, kuno wotowa mhambaga zao kwa kunyunyuwala. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wanhu wose wamjuwile Yesu na watwanzi wamuwinzile kulawa Galilaya, wema kwa kutali wolola mbuli azo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozikigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 27:57-61; Mlk 15:42-47; Yoh 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kukala na munhu imoja twaga jake Yusufu, munhu wa Mkitala, kakala munhu yanogile na kutenda goyolonda Mulungu. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Keza kulawa Yudea buga da Alimataya na kakala kobeta kwiza kwa Undewa wa Mulungu. Hamoja kakala imoja wa wakulu wa mkitala, hagatogole gaja gawalondile wayage na gaja gawakalile wotenda. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kachola kwa Pilato, kampula lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Abaho kaluhumulusa hasi ulukuli, kaluzingiliza sitili, kalwika mdipanga disongoligwe mdibwe, dikalile hadinazikiligwa munhu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ikala ijumaa, siku ayo ikala siku ya kuitanda siku ya Kubwihila ikalile behi kusonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Watwanzi waja wamkweleleze Yesu kulawa Galilaya wachola na Yusufu, na wajona dipanga na vija vilwikigwe lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Abaho wabwela ukae, watanda mavuta gonung'hila goya walubake lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Mna isiku ya Kubwihila wabwihila kamba Malagizo ga Musa vigalagize.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 28:1-10; Mlk 16:1-8; Yoh 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jumapili imitootondo ng'hani, watwanzi waja wachola kudipanga, kuno wasola mavuta gonung'hila goya gawatandile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wadivika idibwe dibimbilisigwa hamgwazo wa umulomo wa dipanga,<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Dibwe dibimbilisigwe hamgwazo ya dipanga</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>avo wengila mdipanga, lakini hawaluwone lukuli lwa Mndewa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wema aho kuno woikanganya mbuli ayo, bahaja wanhu wabili wavalile viwalo vizelu chuwee wema behi nao. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuno wamema bwembwe, watwanzi waja waidulika hasi, wanhu waja wawalongela, “Habali momzahila munhu yeli mgima mna iwanhu wafile? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hano kahaduhu, kazilibuka. Kumbukeni vija viyawalongele viyakalile Galilaya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yageligwe mmakono ga wanhu wotenda nzambi, awo womuwamba mumsalaba, na siku ya kadatu kozilibuka!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Baho watwanzi waja wazikumbuka mbuli zake, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Walawa mdipanga, na wawalongela wanahina longo na imoja mbuli zose zino na wanhu wayagwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Watwanzi awo wakala, Malia Magidalena, Yoana na Malia mamake Yakobo, awo hamoja na watwanzi wayagwe wawalongela watumigwa mbuli azo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini watumigwa wagesa kamba mbuli zilongigwe na iwatwanzi waja za ubozi, na hawawatogolele bule. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Petulo kenuka na kakimbila mbaka kudipanga, kasungulila mgati, kayona sitili iiyeka. Abaho kabwela ukae kuno kokanganya kija kilawilile.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kuchola Emau</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 16:12-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Siku didija wanahina wabili wa Yesu wakala wochola kuna ikijiji kimoja kikemigwe Emau, kikala utali wa kilometa longo na imoja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilometa longo na imoja sawa na maili saba</char></note> kulawa Yelusalemu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>wakala wosimulila usheha wa mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Viwakalile wosimulila, Yesu mwenyego kakwesa behi kailongoza nao. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wamona, lakini wafisigwa sekewamjuwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mosimulila usheha gani kuno mogenda?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nao wema wanyamala tuluu, na vihanga vao vogela bazi kwa kunyunyuwala. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imoja wao yakemigwe Kileopa, kamuuza, “Vino, gweye wiiyeka ayo huli mwenekae wa Yelusalemu hujuwile mbuli zilawilile kuko sambi sambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kawauza, “Mbuli gani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nao wamwidika, “Mbuli zimulawilile Yesu wa Nazaleti, munhu ayo kakala mtula ndagu wa Mulungu na kakala yokoneka mgameso ga Mulungu na wanhu wose kamba kana udahi kwa kila kinhu kiyalongile na kiyatendile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na walangulizi zetu wamgela mmakono yatagusigwe kufa, na yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na tweye tutamanila kamba heyo ayo yonda yawakombole wanhu wa Izilaeli! Lakini lelo siku ya kadatu toka zilawilile mbuli zino. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Watwanzi wayagwe wa mdibumbila jetu watukanganya, imitootondo wachola kuna dipanga, <verse number="23" style="v"/>lakini hawaluvikile lukuli lwake. Wabwela walonga wawona wasenga wa kuulanga wawalongela kamba, Yesu mgima. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe wa mkibumbila chetu wachola kuna dipanga na wavika vivija viwawalongele watwanzi awo, lakini hawamonile bule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mwa wabozi, na mizoyo yenu midala kutogola gose galongigwe na watula ndagu wa Mulungu! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vino, halondigwa Kilisito Mkombola yadununzike kamba avo, abaho yengile muukulu wake?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawasimulila gaja galongigwe na Maandiko Gang'alile mbuli yake mwenyego, kusongela mna ivitabu va Musa na maandiko ga watula ndagu wose wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Viwavikile behi na ikijiji kiwakalile wochola, Yesu kaitenda kamba kogendelela na mwanza, <verse number="29" style="v"/>lakini wamgoma ng'hani, wolonga, “Ukale na tweye, zuwa dihonga na ziza dokwingila.” Avo kagenda na kukala nao. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kakala hasi na kuja nao, kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu, abaho kadibanzula kawagwaa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bahaja, meso gao gagubuligwa na wamjuwa, lakini kapotela mgameso gao. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wailongela, “Vino, mizoyo yetu hayakile na kimuhemuhe vitukalile mnzila kotulongela na kotusimulila Maandiko Gang'alile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bahaja wenuka wabweleganya Yelusalemu, kuko wawavika wanahina longo na imoja wakala hamoja na wanhu wayagwe, <verse number="34" style="v"/>wolonga, “Mndewa kazilibuka kweli! Kamulawilila Simoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wanhu waja wawasimulila kija kiwalawilile mnzila, na vija viwamjuwile Yesu viyadibanzule gate.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">Mat 28:16-20; Mlk 16:14-18; Yoh 20:19-23; Sang'h 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wanhu waja viwakalile wang'hali wowasimulila mbuli azo, bahaja Yesu kema hagati yao, kawalongela, “Zihozeni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wasinhuka na kudumba wagesa wokona mzimu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Habali modumba na kunyawanyawa? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Loleni makono gangu na magulu gangu, na mojuwa kamba ayo niye. Mbabaseni mojuwa, kwavija mzimu waduhu lukuli na mizege, kamba vimnyona niye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Viyalongile avo, kawalagusila makono gake na magulu gake. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wakala wang'hali hawatogola, kwavija wakala wodeng'helela na kukanganya, avo Yesu kawauza, “Mna kinhu chochose chakuja hano?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wamgwaa kihande cha somba yakokigwe, <verse number="43" style="v"/>kakisola, kakija mgameso gao.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Abaho kawalongela, “Mbuli zino azo ziniwalongeleni ving'halile hamoja na mweye, kamba gose gandikigwe mbuli ya niye mna Gamalagizo ga Musa, na gandikigwe na watula ndagu wa Mulungu, na Zabuli galondeka galawilile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Baho kazigubula nzewele zao wadahe kugajuwa Maandiko Gang'alile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kawalongela, “Vino avo yandikigwe, Kilisito Mkombola kolondeka yadununzike na siku da kadatu kozilibuka kulawa kwa wafile, <verse number="47" style="v"/>kwa twaga jake, usenga wopetigwa kwa wanhu wa isi zose, kusongela Yelusalemu, muladi waleke nzambi zao na Mulungu yazigele kumgongo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Na mweye awo wasindila wa mbuli azo. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Na niye nowagalila ija iyalongile Tatangu. Lakini beteni kudibuga mbaka nguvu vonda iwezileni kulawa uchanha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mlk 16:19-20; Sang'h 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Abaho kawalongoza kunze kudibuga mbaka Betania, ako kenula makono gake, kawatambikila. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Viyakalile kowatambikila, kawaleka kagaligwa kuulanga. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wamtambikila na wabwela Yelusalemu kwa deng'ho kulu, <verse number="53" style="v"/>kipindi chose wakala Mng'anda ya Mulungu na kumgwaa nhogolwa Mulungu.</para>
</usx>
